<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Alum nya elkpin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Go mbomannahb Ellum ni jolo. Ellum nio ni jolo a Esowo. Ellum nio ni jolo Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:1-2; Ell 19:13</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ellum nio ni jolo a Esowo go mbomannahb. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ni ni Esowo ko, lim nsol kpee. Ki li ye, kehn ejumjum jolem jolo ji ma jol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:16</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ege wo elkpin jolo no. Elkpin nia ni jolo ellennge ka ane. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ellennge nio li ana agun nya kpꞌyake go ejannge. Ejannge jio ka tiki lahme agun nyao.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nne awohng jolo go, no Esowo tum-e no, no bo jo lung-e re Jon. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Á ba re á ba yiimi ntianse bade ellennge nio, eji ane kpee lꞌtaame tib go alum nya á bungu no. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ye sang jolo ellennge nio. Á ba re á ba yiimi ntianse ka ellennge nio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 3:15-16</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Etingitingi ellennge ni kpo ka nne awohng awohng ellennge, ni ni ma ba go njini. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Á jolo go njini. Ye wo Esowo ko-e, lim njini nyia. Jol njini nyia, we tikem liingi. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Á ba go ege ejahbe, ane ebe we koom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:14</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ane bao ba ko-e no, fere taame tv mbing enye, bo ba li ane ba á ka bo nsahm re bo jol abon Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:26</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Bo jelem bo ana ane baka baka, jol go elkoro ni anebkal sang, jol bo jelem bo tib ana nne tiri no. Esowo bi jele bo.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ellum nio ni ba siingi nne, fere lene tob-r. Wahr ebnyehn ellub ene, ellub nio ni Nde ka Mmon mmon awohng ewe, no ma gbal go nnoobo, a etingitingi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Jon ji nwohngalahb jo yiimi ntianse ka-e, fere jo rabe re, “Ye wo a, ji n jo bung bada ne re, ‘Nne no kpꞌbake toon-m go njahm gbale sehnge me. Tibre á tohko jol, me n kehm jini.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:58</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Go ege agbal wo, á jo yehke nnoobo, jo ka wahr ane kpee. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Moses wo ka atahm. Nnoobo, a etingitingi, Jisos Kraist wo ko ba ka. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Nnene limm, no ma nyꞌnyehn Esowo, sehngem Mmon mmon awohng no li a Esowo bad bad, ye wo ma lim re wahr kahn Esowo.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etib bi Jon ji nwohngalahb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Alum nya ana, nya Jon bungu no. Eji Jus ji jolo go Jeusalem tumu abalimajom, a abon Livai, bo song bahb-e re, “Ekahmekahme kpee, wo nne awo?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Á kehm lennge ka bo, á gbaamem. Á lennge ka bo re, “Me Kraist sang.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bo kehm-e kpe bahb re, “Ekahmekahme kpee, wo nne awo fono? Anv, wo Elaija woa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Á kehm faange re, “Eꞌee, me Elaija sang.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 17:10-13</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bo kpe-e bahb re, “Anv, wo nnyehnamahr no e kp-e siki woa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Á kpe faange re, “Eꞌee, me nnyehnamahr noo sang.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Bo kehm-e kpe bahb re, “Anv, wo nne awo? Tong-r, eji e lꞌsong tong ane ba tum-r no. Anv, a kpo bung renan bade elna?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Jon kehm faange re, “Me wo li ‘nne no kpꞌrabe go elka emahng re, Tuungen mbang nyi Ntul bahke sehnge, wahn lim tꞌtor’ ana nnyehnamahr Aisaya bungu no.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ane ba tumu bo, Bab Farisi ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Eji a tong-r re, wo Kraist sang, wo Elaija sang, wo nnyehnamahr noo sang, anv, jen ji wahnge a kpꞌwohngo ane alahb?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Jon kehm faange bo re, “N kpo wohngo ane alahb maka maka. Go egahne ellong nne awohng noa yim, no ń kil-e elkahne. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Jol eji á kpꞌbꞌba toon-m go njahm, me n fuumem re me n kehme, fannge alehke akpaketa enye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Nsol nyia kpee limi go Betani, go egbuk Jodan jehko, edi jio ji Jon jo wohngo ane alahb.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmon a Njoro no Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Etoono efung behko Jon kehm nyehne Jisos kpꞌbake go ege. Á kehm bungu re, “Nyehnen, Mmon a Njoro no Esowo, no bahke ba rod abiafem nya njini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 8:32; 1 Pit 1:19; Ell 5:12</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Nne noa wo, n jo bung bada ne re, Nne no kpꞌbake toon-m go njahm gbale sehnge me, tibre á tohko jol, me n kehm jini. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mefono antahng, we n tohkem kahn wuku wuku. Ji wahnge m ba no, fere kpi ane alahb wohngo, li, eji abone Israel lꞌkahn-e.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Jon jo yiimi ntianse re, “N nyehne Etingi Etohko go elfoongo ebbehl ma lohng go ejahbetul Esowo badde ba kuum-e. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Mefono antahng, we n tohkem kahn wuku wuku. Esowo bio bi tum-m no re me m ba wohngo ane alahb, ye wo tong-m re, ‘Nne no, a lꞌnyehn Etingi Etohko ma badde ba kuum-e, ye wo li nne no kpo wohngo ane alahb go Etingi Etohko.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Me n lohko nyehn, fere yiimi ntianse re, ye wo lohko li Mmon no Esowo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agbokombang abatꞌtoono Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Etoono efung behko Jon kpe jol ona, a abatꞌtoono ebe, ane abal. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Á kehm nyehne Jisos, eji á jo jen abake, kehm bungu re, “Nyehnen, Mmon a Njoro no Esowo!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Eji abatꞌtoono bao na abal wuku ano, bo kehm tahme toono Jisos. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Jisos kehm keebe, nyehn bo, eji bo kp-e toono, á kehm bahbe bo re, “Ń kpi jen seb?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bo kehm-e faange re, “Rabbi (ji lohngo re ntꞌtibi), gan wo a kpo kang?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Baan, wahn ba nyehn!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Bo kehm jeke, song nyehn edi ji á jo kang, kehm tob kang o efung bio. Tibre ngare nyio jolo ejum nkaranka eni nyi elgung.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Nne awohng go ellong ane abal bao, no tob wuk ana Jon jo bung, kehm tahme toono Jisos. Bo jo lung-e re Andru ji jolo mmonannyehn a Saimon Pita. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Á gbo mbang song nyehn Saimon mmonannyehn, kehm-e tongo re, “Wahr ebnyehn Mesaya,” (ji lohngo re Kraist). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Á kehm koko Saimon ba a ne goji Jisos.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jisos kehm-e seenge too, kehm bungu re, “Wo Saimon wo, ji mmon a Jon. Bo bahke fere jo lung-a re Kefas ji lohngo re Pita.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lungu Filip, fere lung Natanael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Etoono efung behko Jisos kehm toobo re á bahke tahme go Galili. Owo á nyehne Filip, kehm-e tongo re, “Tahm toon-m!”<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filip lohng go Betsaida, ejahbe ji Andru abola Pita lene no. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filip kehm song nyehn Natanael, kehme tongo re, “Wahr ebnyehn nne no Moses nyono bada ne go nwer atahm, no abanyehnamahr Esowo tob nyon fvfo bada ne, Jisos ji Nasaret, ji mmon a Josef.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanael kehm faange re, “Anv, ejum ajehng ajehng ji nno jia, ji bahke tiki lohng go Nasareta?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:41-42</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filip kehm-e faange re, “Ba wahr tahm, wo ba nyehn!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:17</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Eji Jisos nyehne Natanael kpꞌbake go ege, á kehm bungu bada ne re, “Nyehnen, a wo li etingitingi nne Israel, no enehm abehng abehng ki-e wob go atahng.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanael kehm bahbe Jisos re, “A limi renan, kehm-m kahne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Re Filip kehm-a lungu, n nyehn-a, a jehk no go nnahb eti ji bo kpo lung re efig.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanael kehm bungu re, “Rabbi, a lohko li Mmon no Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 14:33; 16:16</char></note> Wo wo li Ntul no Israel!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Anv, wobtaama, tib eji m ma-a tong re, N nyehn-a go nnahb efiga? A bahke nyehne akpokosi sehnge ana nyi a ma nyehn a.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:44</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Jisos kehm kpe bung tong bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, ḿ bahke nyehne ejahbetul Esowo ma lennge, fere nyehn babenjel kpꞌtahme go ero, fere jo badde ba goji Mmon no nne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Elkak elbal ni jolo go Kana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1 Kor 15:51-52</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:12">Hib 1:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Eji ma kang nfung ebal, elkak elbal jolo go Kena ji Galili. Nnyehn Jisos jolo ona. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Jisos, bo tꞌtob tiing-e elkak elbal nio, a abatꞌtoono ebe. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Eji amahm male no, owo nnyehn Jisos kehm bake ba tong-e re, “Amahm ebmal.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nnenkal, nꞌnan a kp-m tohngo anv kak go ntong nyia?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:48-50</char></note> Ngare nyꞌnyame ka rehng.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Owo nnyehn Jisos kehm tongo alokeltum ba jolo o re, “Limen ajehng ajehng ji á bahk-n tongo!”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Etu ebrakebra jolo ona, nya bo bumu re bo jo ba ru elbo ana atahm ebo bungu no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 7:1-4</char></note> Jolo agburu atulahb nya nnen a nnen, nya etu ajehng ajehng jo yele rehng egalon eltahl, tohko jol ano eltahl egalon ewubu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Song tuken alahb, wahn ba ruru go atulahb nyao!” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus change water into wine" file="lb00135c.tif" size="col" loc="Jon 2:7" ref="2:7">Ana Jisos ko alahb lim siingi amahm</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:7">Bo kehm tuku alahb, ba ruru atulahb nyao kpee.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Limen alahb maa, wahn song ka nfakamahm!” Bo kehm limi, tahm a ma.<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Nfakamahm no elkak nio kehm wuungu alahb mao ma ma siingi amahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:17</char></note> Á kahnem edi ji lohngo lohng ba. Alokeltum bao ba limi lim alahb mao, bo jo kꞌkahn. Owo á kehm lungu nlumanne, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />kehm-e tongo re, “Nne awohng awohng kpo tohko ka amahm ma nno. Eji bo ma wo kpꞌbuumu, á kehm gohro ka bo ma ki ga nob. Wobrod amahm ma nno bum gona tete sik anv!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ngbokambang a nkpokosi nyi Jisos limi no nyi a, á limi go Kana ji Galili. Owo á tibi ellub ene. Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm taame tv-e. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme go Kapenium, a nnyehn, a abonanyehn, a abatꞌtoono ebe. Owo bo kange abon afung ntiil.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tahme go etahk Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mak 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ngare nyio elkak ni aneb Jus ni bo kpo lung re Pasova ebkabbe. Owo Jisos kehm tahme go Jeusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Etahk Esowo ona wo, á nyehne ane ba jo gungu efong, a ejoro, go mbehl, fere nyehn ane ba jo yaange akpohko jehk no, kpꞌyaange akpohko go akpꞌkuru ebo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Jisos kehm soro ko ebrꞌrare, kam ane kpee yehke go etahk Esowo jio, a efong efong fvfo. Á sale akpohko nya abayaangakpohko, fere gbul akpꞌkuru ebo tuubu go. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Á kehm tongo ane bao ba jo gungu mbehl re, “Roden nsol nyia, wahn song a nyi! Kana rod etahk Nsoo, bum ana edi are!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm soro buumu ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Ntir nyi n yehke kak, eji n tuungu etahk Esowo, nyi nyi bahke fere wul-m.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Jus kehm-e bahbe re, “Elliingi ani a bahk-r tibi, eji e lꞌkahn re, a kpi nsahm nyi a kpo lim nsol nyia?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:23</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Waan etahk Esowo jia, m bahke tuungu si ji nfenfe go nfung era.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:61; 27:40,63</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Jus kehm bungu re, “Bo ko nnya atahl abal a nnya erakera, si etahk Esowo jia, ji ji a ma fere tong re, a bahke tuungu si go nfung eraa?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Etahk Esowo ji Jisos jo bung bade, ngubjing enye nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 6:19</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ngare nyi á nyahme go elkv, abatꞌtoono ebe bꞌbuumu alum nyao nya á bungu no. Owo bo kehm taame tv nwer Esowo, fere taame tv alum nya Jisos bungu no.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpꞌkahne ane kpee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Eji Jisos jolo go Jeusalem ngare nyio nyi elkak Pasova, ane gbalee ba taame no tv mbing enye, eji bo nyehne akpokosi nya á jo lim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:42; 11:45</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Á joom bum bo go etingitingi, tibre á jo kahne bo kpee, ana bo li no. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Kpeem fuumu re nne awohng awohng tong-e bade ana ane li no, tibre yefono antahng kꞌkahn ana ntim ane li no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 2:8</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisos, a Nekodimos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Nne a Farisi awohng jolo gona, no bo jo lung-e re Nekodimos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:50; 19:39</char></note> Á jolo nne no woomo go ellong atubesi Jus. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Atv amehng á kehm bake goji Jisos, ba tong-e re, “Rabbi, wahr kpꞌkahne re, wo li ntꞌtibi no Esowo tumu no. Tibre nnene limm, no bahke ma lim akpokosi ana nyaa nya a kpꞌlimi, sehngem re no, Esowo bi jolo a ne.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, Tohko tiki jol re, nne kpe tuungu jini, á nehm tiki nyehn etul bi Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:23</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nekodimos kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, nne bahke kpe tuungu jini renan, eji á ma kul? Á bahke kpe feere na song yel nnyehn go ala, á kpe-e jela?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, Tohko tiki jol re, nne kpe tuungu jini go alahb, a Etingi Etohko, á nehm nyehn etul bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:26; Elt 10:44</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Nne kpo jel nne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:50</char></note> Etohko kpo jel etohko. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ki-a kpe kpo esi mbol mbol, tib eji n tong-a re, Tiki li re wahn kpe tuungu jini. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Nfeb kpo lim edi ajehng ajehng ji kor-e no. A kpo wuk ewahl ewahl. A kpehme kahn edi ji kpꞌlohngo abake, a edi ji fi no. Ano wo tob li jang jang a nne no Etingi Etohko jel-e no.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nekodimos kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, jia kehm jolo renan ana?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Wo ji li na ntꞌtibi Israel, nsol nyia a nehme kahna? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Etingitingi n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, Wahr kpo bung bada nsol nyi e kpꞌkahne, fere jo yiimi ntianse go nsol nyi e ma nyehn. Jol ń nehme tiki taame tv etib ebahre. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Eji m ma-n tong nsol nyi njini nyia, ń kil eltaame, lꞌlim renan, ń kehm taame, n lꞌtong-n nsol nyi ejahbetul Esowo? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Nnene limm, no ma jꞌje go ejahbetul Esowo, sehngem Mmon no nne wo wo ma lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ana Moses rodo nnyo kum go ejangnti, rod jahm ngare nyi bo jolo go elka emahng, ano wo fvfo bo bahke tob rod Mmon no nne, kum go ejangnti, rod jahm, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />eji nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-e, á lꞌbel elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Esowo njini kor-e na, wo, á rodo Mmon mmon awohng ewe ka re, nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-e, á nehm tiki kpo tan, á kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:16</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Tibre Esowo tumem Mmon ewe tv go njini nyia re á ba ka njini ebi. Á tum-e re á ba tahre njini nyia. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Nne no lꞌtaame tv-e, á nehm li ebi. Nne no tohko taame, yebsi lꞌli ebi. Tibre á taamem tv mbing nyi Mmon mmon awohng no Esowo.<verse eid="JHN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ana wo li elam, eji ellennge ma ba go njini. Ane, ejannge ji kpi bo kor sehnge ellennge. Tibre nsol nyi bo kpꞌlimi, li abꞌbi abꞌbi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no kpo lim abꞌbi, ellennge kpo sab-e sab. Á kpehme seb re á jen go edi ji ellennge li no, eji bo lꞌkꞌnyehn abꞌbi enye. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nne no kpo lim jio ji li go etingitingi, ye wo li nne no kpꞌjene go edi ji ellennge li no, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌnyehn nnoobo eltum ni á limi no go elfahle ni Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos, a Jon ji nwohngalahb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme go Judea, a abatꞌtoono ebe. Ona wo bo kange no, jo wohngo ane alahb. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Jon fvfo jo tob wohngo ane alahb go Enon ji li kohlo Salim. Tibre alahb jolo o gbalee. Ane jo je o, song bel ewohngalahb.<verse eid="JHN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ngare nyio, Jon, bo we ka bob kak ngbekobo. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Abatꞌtoono Jon, a nne a Jus awohng, bo kehm kehme nfaabe lim bade eljini ni nne bahke jo bum elne saang. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Owo bo kehm bake goji Jon, kehm ba tong-e re, “Ntꞌtibi, nne noo no jolo a na go egbuk Jodan jehko, no a jo yiimi ntianse ka-e, á noa ona, kpi ane alahb wohngo, nne awohng awohng kpꞌjeke go ege.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Owo Jon kehm faange re, “Nnene limm, no bahke ma bel ejum ajehng ajehng, sehngem re no Esowo bi ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 5:4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Wahnfono antahng ebwuk ana n tong-n no re, Me sang li Kraist. Bo tum-m na re me n gbo-e mbang.<verse eid="JHN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />“Nne no kpi nkal, ye wo li nlumanne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 22:2; 9:15; Ell 19:7</char></note> Eji ntem no nlumanne yim ona, kpꞌwuku alum nya á kpꞌbungu, eltim bahk-e jo yebe sehng. Anv, eyebatahng ejame jia ebgbal. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ye bahke gbale na, me m bahke fere jol reed.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Ye jio ji lohng go ero ba, á gbale sehnge ane kpee. Nne no lohng go njini, á li ka njini. Á kpo bung nyi njini. Nne no lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba, á gbale sehnge ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:23</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Á kpo yiimi ntianse go nsol nyi á ma nyehn, fere wꞌwuk. Nnene limm, no kpꞌtaame tv etib ebe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv etib ebe, bahke lohko tib re, Esowo li go etingitingi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Nne no Esowo m-e tum, á kpo bung alum nya Esowo. Tibre Esowo kpehme gare na etohko eje ka ane. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Esowo, Mmon ewe kor-e sehng, owo wahnge á ma yake nsol enye kpee, kak-e go ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:27</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Nne no lꞌtaame tv Mmon Esowo, á kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Nne no tohko wuk Mmon Esowo, elkpin á nehm bel. Erakatahng ji Esowo ji li a ne.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jisos, a nnenkal a Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Bab Farisi kehm wuku re, Jisos kpo wohngo ane alahb sehnge Jon, ane bao fere jo toon-e. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Jol Jisos wohngem nne awohng awohng alahb, sehngem abatꞌtoono ebe ba ba jo lim ano. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ntul a Jisos sebe kan kahn ano me, á kehm tahme o Judea asongo go Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Tiki jolo re, á sehng go Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Á kehm song rehng go ejahbe Samaria ajehng, ji bo jo lung re Sikar, ji jolo kohlo edi ndi ji Jekob ka mmon ewe Josef. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Elbing alahb ni Jekob jolo ona. Eji Jisos ma lahng eljen, á kehm ba ji o elbing alahb nio. Ngare nyio jolo ngare efin. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Owo nnenkal a Samaria kehm bake re á ba tuk alahb. Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Ka-m alahb, me n wo!”<verse eid="JHN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ngare nyio abatꞌtoono Jisos ebtahm go nla ejahbe re bo song gunu nsol alehke.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nnenkal a Samaria noo kehm-e faange re, “Jen ji wahnge a kp-m bahbe re, me n ka-a alahb, wo ji li na nne a Jus, gana me nne a Samaria?” Tibre Jus, a Samaria, bo kpehme kod abo.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Li re a kpꞌkahne ayare nya Esowo kpo ka, fere kahn nne no kp-a bahbe re, wo ka-e alahb, á wo, kehn a m-e gboongo na, á ka-a alahb mao ma elkpin.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:37-39</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mmonankal noo kehm-e bahbe re, “Nsoo, ejum limm, ji a bahke koko tuk alahb, gana elbing alahb nia kpꞌrahbe. Gan wo a bahke bele alahb mao ma elkpin? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Anv, wo ga gbal sehnge Jekob, nso ejahre, no ka-r elbing alahb nia? Á jo wo alahb ana, a abon abon ebe, a atohkondi enye kpee.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Nne awohng awohng no lꞌwo alahb maa, bahk-e kpe kor. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌwo alahb mao ma m bahk-e kake, ekor bahk-e tane. Alahb mao ma m bahk-e kake, bahke jo tub mbꞌbehl go ege atahng, fere gbo ebgba bi bahke jo fab, rehng go elkpin ni li go njinanjini.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:27,35</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mmonankal noo kehm-e faange re, “Nsoo, ka-m alahb mao ma ekor bahk-m tane, eji n lꞌkꞌkpe ba a, ba tuk alahb elbing nia.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Song, wo song lung nlum ewa, wahn ba!”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mmonankal noo kehm-e faange re, “Nlum awohng awohng n kpimm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Wobbung etingitingi, eji a tongo re, nlum a kpimm. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Wobbel alum na alon. Noo no a jehk-e etahk, etingitingi nlum ewa sang. A lohk-m tong etingitingi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mmonankal noo kehm-e tongo re, “Nsoo, me n lohko kahn re, wo nnyehnamahr wo. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Babnso ejahre jo kake Esowo go ewong jia. Wahn Jus, ń kpo bung re, Go Jeusalem wo li edi ji fuumu re, ane jo ba, ba kak Esowo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Nnenkal, taame tv alum enyame nya n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, Ngare kpꞌbake nyi ń lꞌkꞌkpe kak Esowo Nsoo go ewong jia, jol go Jeusalem fvfo. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Wahn aneb Samaria, ń kpo kak ejum ji ń kil elkahne. Wahr Jus, e kpo kak ji e kpꞌkahne. Tibre eltahre kpo lohng goji Jus. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ngare kpꞌbake nyi atingitingi abakake Esowo bahke jo kak Esowo Nsoo go etohko, a etingitingi. Tibre elkohn ane ana bao ba, Esowo Nsoo kpꞌsebe re bo kak-e. Ngare nyꞌnehm nyi ma rehng a. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Esowo, etohko ji. Bao ba kp-e kake, bahke jo kak-e go etohko, a etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:6,13; Rom 7:6</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mmonankal noo kehm-e tongo re, “N kpꞌkahne re, Mesaya kpꞌbake. Mesaya ji bo kpo lung-e re Kraist lꞌba, á bahk-r tibi nsol kpee.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Me jia ji kpꞌbungu a na, me wo li Mesaya.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:37</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Tvtv ona abatꞌtoono Jisos kehm soro ba. Kpo bo esi area, eji bo nyehne re, á kpꞌbungu a nnenkal. Nnene jolem go bo ellong no bahbe Jisos re, “Jen ji a kpꞌsebe?” Jol bo we bahbem re, “Jen ji wahnge a kpꞌbungu a ne?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Nnenkal noo kehm soro tahm etulahb eje sa, tahm song rehng go nla ejahbe, song tong ane re, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Baan, wahn ba nyehn nne no ma-m tong nsol kpee, nyi n kpo lim. Ma ye wo li Mesaya nji!”<verse eid="JHN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ane bao kehm soro lohng ejahbe jio, tahm song kpiri Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ngare nyꞌnehm nyi abatꞌtoono Jisos jo gboongo Jisos re, “Ntꞌtibi, ko nsol alehke, wo li me!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “N kpi nsol alehke nyi m bahke lehke, nyi ń kil elkahne.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm kehme elbahbe atemtem re, “Anv, nne ebko nsol alehke ba ka-ea?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Nsol alehke enyame li re, me n lim mbang nyi nne no tum-m no, fere gohro mal eltum ene. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Wahn sang kpo kono elbungu re, ‘Ebsa nnyahng eni, ngare elkpake rehnga?’ N kp-n tongo re, wahn tab asamahr enyahne wahre, nyehn ana ebgbe ma kum, ngare ebrehng kpee, nyi elkpake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:2</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Nne no lꞌkpa, á kpo bel eltuuru. Á kpo kpu nsol nyio bum, jol go elkpin ni li go njinanjini, eji mbꞌbahme, a nkpꞌkpake, bo lꞌbel eyebatahng egom egom. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Tibre jia ji bo kpo kono elbungu, lohko li go etingitingi re, ‘Nne noko bahm, noko kpa.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />M ma-n tum re, wahn song kpa egbe jio ji ń ki lim eltum anehng anehng. Ane bako ba ma lim eltum o, wahn ebba yel eltum nio, soro asi kpꞌlimi asongo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Anebe Samaria gbalee ba lene ejahbe jio, kehm taame tv Jisos, tibre mmonankal noo bungu re, “Á tong-m nsol kpee nyi m ma lꞌlim.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Eji anebe Samaria bao ba goji Jisos, bo gboong-e re, á lub song kang a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 5:17</char></note> Owo Jisos kehm song kang a bo nfung ebal. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ane gbalee kpe taame budu, tib go ege alum nya á bungu no. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bo kehm tongo mmonankal noo re, “Wahr ebtaame anv. Lohngem re, wahr ebtaame tib eji a tong-r no. Wahr ebtaame, tibre wahrfono antahng ebwuk. Wahr eblohko kahn go etingitingi re, ye wo li ntꞌtahre no njini.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi mmon a ntubesi ejahbe, á nob eyam ebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Jisos kange kan nfung ebal o me, á kehm tahme go Galili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 4:12</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Tibre Jisos jo yiimi ntianse antahng antahng re, “Nnyehnamahr Esowo kpehme lub go ege ejahbe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 6:4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Eji Jisos ba no, ba rehng go Galili, anebe Galili jo vvr-e sehng, tib eji bo nyehne akpokosi nya á limi no go Jeusalem ngare elkak. Tibre bofono tꞌtob je elkak nio.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Á kehm feere tahm go Kena ji Galili, ejahbe jio ji á ko alahb lim, siingi amahm. Ntubesi ejahbe awohng jolo go Kapenium, no mmon ewe jo yam. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Á wuku kan re, Jisos eblohng go Judea ba go Galili, á kehm bake goji Jisos, ba gboong-e re, á je go Kapenium, song lim mmon ewe, á nob. Tibre mmon ewe nong go emel elkv.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Tohko tiki jol re, ń nyehne akpokosi, ń kpehme tiki taame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 2:18; 1 Kor 1:22</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ntubesi ejahbe noo kehm-e tongo re, “Nsoo, ba wahr tahm, mmon ewame yahke kpo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Song, mmon ewa bahke kpini!” Nne noo kehm soro taame tv alum nya Jisos bungu no tong-e, kehm soro tahm eje.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Eji á jo kehnge, alokeltum ebe kehm ba wan-e go mbang, kehm-e tongo re, “Mmon ewa kpeke li go elkpin.”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Á kehm bahbe bo ngare nyi mmon ewe kehme elnobo. Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Nyaane ngare efin nkaranka anyehng, owo á nobo arumbum nyao.”<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Nde mmon kehm soro buumu tvtv re, ngare nyio nyi Jisos tong-e re, “Mmon ewa bahke kpini.” Yefono antahng kehm taame tv-e, a ane ba lene go ege a nlaaga kpee.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Etoono nkpokosi nyi a, nyi Jisos kpe lim ngare nyio nyi á lohngo go Judea, feere go Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Nne no nobo no go Betsata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Eji nsol nyio ma sehng kpee, owo Jisos kehm tahme go Jeusalem. Tibre ngare nyio jolo ngare elkak ni Jus. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Go Jeusalem, go eti mbu jio ji bo jo lung re, Eti Mbu Ejoro, owo eto jolo no, ji bo si nkpatahk elon sennge kak. Eto jio bo jo lungu go alum Hibru re Betsata. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ona wo ellong ane gbalee noongo no, jo yam, awakamahr, abanne, a aneb ayam bandiki. (Bo jo baabe re alahb gbehke. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Tibre ngare nyimongo enjel nyi Jehova jo ba yel alahb mao, jo gbehke alahb. Nne eyam awohng awohng no lꞌfere gbo mbang song yel go alahb, eji kpꞌgbehke, ye wo bahke nobo eyam ebe, afi á bele elkohn eyam abehng abehng.)<verse eid="JHN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Nne awohng jolo noa, no eyam ebe ma kang eltahl a nnya elku a nnya era. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Eji Jisos nyehn-e no, fere kahn re, yebnoongo ona edi jio ekidi eblab, á kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, a kpꞌsebe re wo noba?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nne eyam noo kehm-e faange re, “Ee nsoo, wo, nnene n kpimm, no bahk-m rodo kak go eto jia, eji alahb ma kehme elgbehke. N lꞌtahm re me n song yel, nne noko go tohko gbo mbang ka-m.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Tahm, wo rod ekpa eja, jen song!”<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Tvtv ona nne noa kehm soro nob eyam ebe, kehm rodo ekpa eje, kehme eljene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Efung bio jolo efung Esabat. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Aneb Jus kehm tongo nne noo no ma nob eyam ebe re, “Lela efung Esabat bi. Nobem re wo sol ekpa eja.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 2:27; 3:4</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nne noo kehm faange bo re, “Nne no lim-m no, n nob, ye wo tong-m re, ‘Rod ekpa eja, wo jen song!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Nne awo tong-a tong re, wo rod ekpa eja, jen song?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Nne noo no nobo eyam ebe kahnem nne no lim-e lim, á nob. Tibre Jisos tꞌtahm, eji ellong ane kame no ba rur o.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Eji ma ji ntiil, Jisos kehm song nyehn-e go etahk Esowo, kehm-e tongo re, “Nyehnee, anv wobnob. Ka kpe lim abiafem, eji ejum ji sabe sehnge jia lꞌki-a kpe lim.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:11</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Nne noo kehm tahme song tong Jus re, Jisos wo lim-e no, á nob.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Owo wahng ka Jus kehm kehme Jisos gbak, tib eji á limi nne nob efung Esabat.<verse eid="JHN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Nsoo kpi nlimi nlimi eltum. Me fvfo, n kpꞌtob lim eltum.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Jia ji wahnge anebe Jus kpe bel erakatahng gbalee tob-e, fere jo seb mbang ana nyi bo bahk-e wulu. Tibre bo jo bungu re, Jisos, ntahm Esabat nyi nyi sang á soodo no, á kpe bung re, Esowo, Nde no we wo, ji lohngo re, á kpꞌrodo elne bum jang jang a Esowo.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsahm nyi Mmon no Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Mmon nehm ma lim ejumjum go ege a ngang antahng, sehngem ji á lꞌnyehn Nde kpꞌlimi, ji ji á kpo tob lim. Ajehng ajehng ji Nde lꞌlim, jꞌnehm ji Mmon kpo tob lim. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Tibre Nde, Mmon ewe kp-e koro sehng, owo wahnge á kp-e tibi nsol kpee nyi yefono antahng kpꞌlimi. Á bahk-e tibi nsol nyi gbale sehnge nyia a, eji lꞌjo kpo-n esi. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ana Nde kpo nyahme ane go elkv, bo fere bel elkpin, ano wo fvfo Mmon bahke tob ka nne awohng awohng elkpin, no kor-e no. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Nsoo kpehme lam nne awohng awohng. Yebfaake elam eje kpee ka Mmon ewe re<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:31</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkak Mmon ewe, jang jang ana bo kpo kak Nde. Nne no tohko kak Mmon ewe, lohngo re, á nehme kak Nde no tum-e no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:10-11</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />kpꞌ“Etingitingi, n bungu tong-n re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌwuk alum enyame, fere taame tv nne no tum-m no, á kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Bo we nehm kpe lam. Yebsehng elkv sa rehng go elkpin. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Ngare kpꞌbake, ngare nyꞌnehm nyi ma rehng a, nyi akvne bahke wuku alum nya Mmon Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:5-6</char></note> Bao ba lꞌwuk, bo bahke jolo go elkpin.<verse eid="JHN 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />“Ana Nsoo kpi nsahm antahng nyi á kpo ko, ka elkpin, ano wo fvfo á ma tob lim Mmon ewe re, á tob bel nsahm nyi á bahke tob jo ka elkpin. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Á m-e ka nsahm nyi á bahke jo lam alam. Tibre ye wo li Mmon no nne. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nong, ki-n kpe kpo esi mbol mbol. Tibre ngare bahke bake nyi akvne kpee nya wob go alahm bahke wuku alum enye. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Bo bahke nyahme lohng go alahm. Bao ba limi nob nob bahke nyahme, jol go elkpin. Bao ba limi abꞌbi bahke nyahme, ba yiimi go eti elam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:31-32; Ell 20:12-13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abayiimintianse ba Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“N nehm ma lim ejumjum go egame eko. Ana n kpo wuk goji Esowo, ano wo n kpo lam. Elam ejame li go etingitingi. Tibre n nehme lim mbang nyꞌnyame. N kpꞌlimi mbang nyi nne no tum-m no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:38</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />N lꞌyiimi ntianse ka elname antahng, ntianse enyame nehm lub. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nne noko noa, no kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka-m. N kpꞌkahne re, ntianse nyi á kpꞌyiimi ka-m, lohko li go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:7-9</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ń tumu ane tv Jon ji jo yiimi ntianse ka etingitingi jia. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Jol nnene n sebem re á yiimi ntianse ka-m. M bungu jia, eji wahn lꞌbel eltahre. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Jon jolo ana etꞌrekahng ji jo lul, fere jo yꞌya. Jo kor-n re wahn jo bel eyebatahng mmongare ntiil tib go ege ellennge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 7:24-28</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Ntianse nyi me n kpi no, gbale sehnge nyi Jon. Tibre akpokosi nyao nya Nsoo ma-m ka re me n lim, eltum nꞌnehm ni n kpꞌlimi a, ni ni kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka-m re, Nsoo wo tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Nsoo no tum-m no wo yiimi ntianse antahng antahng ka-m. Ellum ene wahn ka wuk a wuk, jol esamahr ebe ń ka nyehn a nyehn. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Ellum ene go egahne atahng wobem. Tibre ń nehme taame tv nne no á tum-e no. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ń kpo kpili nwer Esowo, tibre ń kpo tir re, ona wo ḿ bahke bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Nwer Esowo nyio nyi kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka me.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 24:27</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />“Wahn nehme kor elbake go egame, eji ń lꞌbel elkpin.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“N kpehme ko ellub goji ane. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Tibre n kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, ekor ji Esowo wobem go egahne atahng. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />M ba go mbing nyi Nsoo. M-e ń nehme ko. Nne nondiki lꞌfere ba go ege a mbing, ye wo ḿ bahk-e koko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 2:4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Bahke limi renan, ń kehm taame tv Esowo, eji ń kpo ko ellub goji ane? Esowo bi li na abehng, ellub ene ń kpehme seb.<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Kana tir re, m bahk-n kake ebi go esamahr Nsoo. Moses wo bahk-n kake ebi, ye jio ji ń kpꞌkunu ekpu go ege.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:11-13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />“Li re ń kpꞌtaame tv Moses, kehn ń kpꞌtob taame tv-m. Tibre Moses nyꞌnyon bada name. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Eji ń kil eltaame tv alum enye nya á nyono no, bahke limi renan, ń kehm taame tv alum enyame?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos le ellong ane gbalee (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme go egbuk eto jehko ji Galili, ji bo jo tob lung re eto ji Taibirias. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ellong ane gbalee kehm-e toono, tibre bo jo nyehne akpokosi nya á jo lim aneb ayam, bo nob. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Jisos kehm wahre go ewong, song ji a abatꞌtoono ebe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ngare nyio elkak Pasova ni Jus ebkabbe.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Eji Jisos tabe esamahr ebe wahre, nyehn ellong ane bao kpꞌbake, á kehm bahbe Filip re, “E bahke limi renan, kehm gunu abred nya ane bao kpee bahke lehke?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Á bungu ellum nia re á wuung-e. Tibre yefono antahng jo kꞌkahn kpee ji á bahke limi.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filip kehm-e faange re, “Mpon eltahl, e lꞌko gunu abred, jol nehm tohko bꞌbiingi bo, afi nne awohng awohng jo li ntiil.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Ntꞌtoono ewe awohng no bo jo lung-e re Andru ji mmonannyehn a Saimon Pita, kehm-e tongo re, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Mmonse awohng li ana, no kpi ebred na eblon, a abon nsahre na abal. Anv, nyaa a, tohko lꞌli jen, ka ellong ane ana nia?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Tongen ane bao, bo ji ndi.” Tibre ajele jolo gbalee edi jio. Owo ane bao kehm jehke ndi. Bo jolo ejum aneblum atahltahl nkpel ewubbal atahl awubu (5,000).<verse eid="JHN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Jisos kehm rodo abred nyao, kak Esowo saam, kehm bake ane bao ba ji go ndi. Ano wo fvfo á tob lim go abon nsahre bao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:11">Nne awohng awohng li ana kor-e no.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Eji bo ma wohngo ane kpee, Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Taaren bo erik ji ma sa, eji ejum ajehng ajehng lꞌkꞌrannge mbol mbol.”<verse eid="JHN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ebred eblon bi ane bao li no, bo kehm song taare erik ji sa no, ruru ewubu ejeere na ebbal.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ane bao nyehne kan nkpokosi nyi Jisos ma lim, bo kehm kehme elbungu re, “A wo lohko li nnyehnamahr Esowo no e jo wuk re, á bahke bake go njini.”<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Eji Jisos sebe kahn re, bo yahke ba, ba bob-e etul go nsahm, á kehm tahme bo sa, tahm go ewong ntahngtahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 14:22-23; 20:26; Jon 18:36; Rom 12:16</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jene go ero alahb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Eji elgung ba no, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm tahme go nkpe eto, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />kehm song yel go egbang, kehm kehme elfingi re bo siiri eto jio rehng go Kapenium go egbuk jehko. Ngare nyio ejannge ebgbo. Jisos ka tiki ba, ba kpiri bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Alahb kehm kehme ebuku lim, tibre nfeb jo limi sehng. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bo fingi kan ejum mmal era, fundiki mmal eni, bo kehm soro nyehn Jisos kpꞌjene go ero alahb, jo kabbe go bo egbang. Bo kehm kehme elfahle.<verse eid="JHN 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Kana kpe fahl, me wo!”<verse eid="JHN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Eltim yebe bo sehng. Bo kehm-e solo go egbang. Tvtv ona egbang kehm soro rehng egbuk eto jehko ji bo jo jꞌje.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane jo seb Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Etoono efung behko, ellong ane ba sa go egbuk eto jehko kehm sebe kahn re, egbang abehng bi bi jolo o. Egbang bio, Jisos yelem. Abatꞌtoono ebe ba, ba yel egbang bio tahm asongo bo bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Owo agbang nyandiki kehm lohngo go Taibirias ba edi ji bo li abred nyao ngare nyi Ntul a Jisos ma kak Esowo saam. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Eji ane bao sebe no kahn re, Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe, ona bo limm, bo kehm kpe yel agbang tahm go Kapenium, song seb Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li ebred ji elkpin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Eji bo nyehn-e no go egbuk eto jehko, bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntꞌtibi, ngare anyi a rehnge a?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Elsebe ni ń kp-m sebe, ḿ m-e nehme seb tib eji ń nyehne akpokosi. Abred nya ń li wohngo, nya nya wahnge ń kp-m sebe. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kana kpe nyennge, jo lim eltum ni ḿ bahke bele nsol alehke nyi bahke tane na. Jo noken mbang nyi ḿ bahke bele nsol alehke nyi bahke jolo go njinanjini, nyi Mmon no nne bahk-n kake. Tibre ye wo, Esowo Nsoo m-e kak elliingi nio ni nsahm enye.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Jen ji e bahke lꞌlim, kehm jo lim eltum ni Esowo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Eltum ni Esowo kpꞌsebe re wahn lim, li re, wahn taame tv nne no á tum-e no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:23</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Owo bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Elliingi ani a bahke tibi, ni e bahke nyehne, kehm taame tv-a? Nkpokosi anyi a bahke limi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Babnso ejahre jo li nsol nyi bo kpo lung re mmanna go elka emahng, jang jang ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, ‘Á ka bo abred nya lohng go ejahbetul Esowo re bo li.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Moses sang ka-n abred nya lohng go ejahbetul Esowo. Nsoo wo kp-n kake etingitingi ebred ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Tibre ebred ji Esowo li ebred ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo, ba ka njini elkpin.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Nsoo, jo ka-r ebred jio ngare anyehng anyehng!”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Me wo li ebred ji elkpin. Nne no lꞌba go egame, njal we nehm kpe yam. Nne no lꞌtaame tv-m, ekor alahb bahk-e tane. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />M ma-n tong re, ḿ ma-m nyehn, jol ń nehme tiki taame. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Nne awohng awohng no Nsoo ka-m ye, ye wo bahke bake go egame. Nne no lꞌba go egame, we n nehm kam yake go. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Tibre n lohngo go ejahbetul Esowo ba re me m ba lim mbang nyi Nsoo no tum-m no. Mbang nyꞌnyame sang m ba ellimi. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ejum ji ana, ji Nsoo no tum-m no tong-m re me n lim. Á tong-m re, me n kꞌwahng nne awohng awohng tan, no á ma-m ka. M bahke nyahme bo go elkv esꞌkohro efung.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:24</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />A wo tob li ejum ji Nsoo kpꞌsebe re, nne awohng awohng no lꞌnyehn Mmon ewe fere taame, á bahke bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini. M bahk-e nyahme go esꞌkohro efung.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Jus kehm kehme elmemme atemtem tob-e, tib eji á bungu re, “Me wo li ebred ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bo kehm bungu re, “Jisos sang aa, ji li mmon a Josef, ji e kpꞌkahne nde, a nnyehna? Jen ji wahnge á bahke kehm bungu re, á lohngo go ejahbetul Esowo ba?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Kana kpe memme atemtem! <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Nnene limm, no bahke ma ba go egame, tohko jol re Nsoo no tum-m no wo leeb-e. M bahk-e nyahme go elkv esꞌkohro efung. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Tibre abanyehnamahr Esowo nyono re, ‘Esowo bahke bo tib, bo ane kpee.’ Nne awohng awohng no ma wuk, fere kpili goji Nsoo, á bahke bake go egame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:46</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />“Jia lohngem re, nne awohng awohng ebnyehn Nsoo, sehngem nne no lohng goji Esowo Nsoo ba, ye wo ma nyehn Nsoo. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne no lꞌtaame, á kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Me wo li ebred ji elkpin. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Babnso ejahne jo li mmanna go elka emahng. Bobkpo kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:3,5</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />“A wo li ebred ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba, ji nne lꞌli, á lꞌkꞌkpo. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Me wo li ebred ji elkpin, ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌli ebred jia, á bahke bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Ebred ji m bahke kake njini re bo bel elkpin, ngubjing enyame nyi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:5,10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Jus kehm kehme nfaabe lim atemtem re, “Bahke limi renan, nne noa kehm-r kake ngubjing enye, wahr li?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Tohko tiki jol re, ń li ngubjing nyi Mmon no nne, fere wo alung eme, ń nehm tiki bel elkpin go egahne atahng. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Nne no kpo li ngubjing enyame, fere jo wo alung emame, á kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini. M bahk-e nyahme go elkv esꞌkohro efung. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Tibre ngubjing enyame lohko li etingitingi ejum alehke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 4:4</char></note> Alung emame tob li etingitingi ejum elwoko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:7</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Nne no lꞌli ngubjing enyame, fere jo wo alung emame, á wob-m go eltim, me n tob wob-e go eltim. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Nsoo no li go elkpin wo tum-m. Esi eje ji wahnge n tob li go elkpin. Nne no lꞌli ngubjing enyame, á bahke tob jol go elkpin tib go egame esi. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />A wo li ebred ji lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba. Limm ana elkohn ni babnso ejahne li no, fere kpo. Nne no lꞌli ebred jia, á bahke jolo go njinanjini.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jisos jo bungu alum nyaa, eji á jo tib go etahk ero ji jolo go Kapenium.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya kpi elkpin ni li go njinanjini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Egom abatꞌtoono Jisos gbalee, eji bo wuku alum nyao, bo kehm bungu re, “Alum nyao kpꞌriidi sehng. Nne awo bahke ma wuungu atung go nsol nyio?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Eji Jisos sebe kahn re, abatꞌtoono ebe kpꞌmemme bade alum nyao, owo á kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, alum nya m bungu a, ma-n saba? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ḿ bahke bungu renan, ń lꞌnyehn Mmon no nne kpꞌfeere go ero edi ji á tohko jol?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 1:9</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Etohko ji kpo ka elkpin, ngubjing o mbol mbol wo. Alum nya m ma bung tong-n li etohko etohko, a elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:6,17</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Egom ejahne jindiki jia, ji kil eltaame.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:64">Jisos bungu ellum nia a, tibre á jo kahne kpee mboma mbomo. Á jo kahne egom ji lꞌkꞌtaame, fere kahn nne no bahk-e gungu.<verse eid="JHN 6:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Á kehm bungu re, “Owo wahnge n tong-n no re, Nnene limm, no bahke ma ba go egame, sehngem re no, Nsoo wo limi mbang ka-e.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Tib go alum nyao, egom abatꞌtoono ebe gbalee kehm soro yaam-e sa, tahm ebo. Bo we kpeem jo tiki toono.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Jisos kehm bahbe abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal re, “Wahn fvfo, ḿ bahke tob yaam-m saa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Saimon Pita kehm-e faange re, “Ntul, eji nyehne wo, e bahke jeke? Wo wo kpi alum nyao nya elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Wahr ebtaame, fere kahn re, wo wo li Mbarebara nne no Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:16</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Wahn sang n jak-n no yehka, wahn ewubu ane abala? Nne awohng go egahne ellong, nnehm nyi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Á bungu bade Judas ji mmon a Saimon Iskariot, ji woomo go ellong ane ebe, ewubu ane abal. Tibre ye wo jolo nne no bahk-e gungu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Jisos, a abonanyehn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Eji nyao kpee ma mal, Jisos kehm tahme, jo yannge go Galili. Á joom yannge go Judea, tibre Jus jo sebe re bo wul-e. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ngare nyio ona elkak ni Jus jo si nkpatahk jo woomo, ebkabbe.<verse eid="JHN 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Owo abonanyehn Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Tahm, wo song go Judea, eji abatꞌtoono eba lꞌnyehn akpokosi nya a kpꞌlimi me! <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Nnene limm, no kpo behr nsol nyi á kpꞌlimi, eji á kpꞌsebe re nne awohng awohng kahn-e. A lꞌkehme nsol enya lim, jo tib elna go njini.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Jol abonanyehn fvfo joom taame tv-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:21; Elt 1:14</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ngare enyame ka biingi. Ngare nyꞌnyahne li ngare anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Njini nyia, ekv bo wahn nehme ko, me wo, bo kp-m koko ekv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:18</char></note> tibre n kpo tong bo re, mbang nyi bo kpꞌtoono nobem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:51-54</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Songen go elkak nio wahn wahn. Me n nehme tahm elkak anv, tibre ngare enyame ka biingi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Á bungu kan ano me, á kehm sake eje go Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos je go elkak ni bo jo si nkpatahk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ngare nyi abonanyehn ma tahm go elkak, á kehm tob tahm fvfo. Á joom jen gbul gbul gbuul, á jo jene mbehr mbehr.<verse eid="JHN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Jus jo seb-e go elkak nio, fere jo bahb re, “Ye nona?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ellong ane bao jo bungu awꞌwa bada ne. Bandiki jo bungu re, “Á li nnooba nne.” Bandiki re, “Eꞌee, á kpꞌnehme na ane.”<verse eid="JHN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Tib eji bo jo fahl Jus, nnene jolem, no jo bung gbul gbul gbuul bada ne.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Elkak nio kpo kang nfung enehkeni. Elka elka ene wo, Jisos tahme go etahk Esowo, song kehme eltibi.<verse eid="JHN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Kehm kpoko Jus esi, bo kehm kehme elbungu re, “Jen ji wahnge nne noa kpꞌkahne elkahne ana nia, jol eji á ki jꞌje nwer?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:54; Elt 4:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Eltibi ename ni n kpꞌtibi a, nꞌname sang, ni Esowo bi tum-m no ni. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Nne awohng awohng no kpꞌsebe re, á lim mbang nyi Esowo, á bahke kahne, joare eltibi ename ni n kpꞌtibi lohko lohng goji Esowo, afi n kpo bung go egama nsahm. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Nne no kpo bung go ege a nsahm, á kpo seb ellub nꞌne. Nne no kpꞌsebe ellub ni nne no tum-e no, á lohko li go etingitingi, ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng á kpimm. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moses sang ka-n atahma? Nne ewahne awohng awohng limm, no kpꞌbumu atahm nyao.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 15:10</char></note> Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌsebe re wahn wul-m?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ane bao kehm faange re, “A kpi ebi etohko go ega atahng. Nne awo kpꞌsꞌseb re á wul-a?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:48,52; 10:20</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “N limi nkpokosi anyehng ana nyꞌnyehng, jo kpo-n esi, wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Moses tong-n re, wahn jo yehke abon ebahne nrur. (Lohngem re, Moses wo ko nrur ayehke ba a nyi, lohng goji babnso ejahre.) Wahn kpo yehke mmon nrur efung Esabat. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Bo lꞌyehke mmon nrur efung Esabat, eji atahm nya Moses lꞌkꞌrange, jen ji wahnge lꞌlun ntim enyahne kp-n rake tob-m, tib eji n limi nne eyam nob kpee go ege a ngubjing efung Esabat?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:6</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Kana jo lam alam ane ana ń kpꞌnyehne esamahr ebo. Jo lamen elam ji nno!”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ye wo li Mesayaa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Aneb Jeusalem bandiki kehm bungu re, “Nne noa sang bo kpꞌsebe re bo wul-ea? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Ye sang ana, kpꞌbungu gbul gbul gbuula? Jol nnene nehme bung ejumjum tob-e. Ma atubesi ebahre eblohko kahn re, ye Mesaya wo nji. <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Wahr kpꞌkahne edi ji nne noa lohng no. Mesaya lꞌba, nnene limm, no bahke kahne edi ji á bahke lohngo ba.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Eji Jisos jo tib go etahk Esowo, á kehm jo bung wahre wahre re, “Ń kp-m kahne, ń kpꞌtob kahn edi ji n lohng no ba. M baam antahng a. Nne no tum-m no li go etingitingi. Wahn, we ń nehme kahn. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />N kp-e kahne, tibre n lohng go ege ba. Ye wo tum-m no.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Owo bo kehm gare re bo bob Jisos, jol nnene jolem, no lak-e abo. Tibre ngare enye ka biingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:20; Luk 22:53</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ane gbalee jolo go ellong nio ba taame tv Jisos. Bo jo bungu re, “Anv, Mesaya lꞌba, á bahke limi akpokosi sehnge ana nya nne noa ma lima?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jus tumu alokeltum ebo re bo song bob Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Bab Farisi kehm wuku ana ellong ane bao jo bung awꞌwa bada Jisos. Owo atubesi abalimajom, a Bab Farisi kehm tumu alokeltum ebo re bo song bob Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “M bahke kpe jol a nahne ana mmongare ntiil, kehm tahme goji nne no tum-m no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:33</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ḿ bahk-m sebe, m-e ń nehm kpe nyehn. Edi ji m bahke jeke, ń nehm ma ba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:21; 14:28</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Jus kehm kehme elbahbe atemtem re, “Gan wo nne noa kpꞌbungu re, á yahke tahm, eji e lꞌki-e kpe nyehn? Anv, á yahke tahm goji Jus ji lene go ajahbe Grika, fere song tib aneb Grika? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Anv, jio ona lohngo renan, ji á kpꞌbungu re, ‘Ḿ bahk-m sebe, m-e ń nehm kpe nyehn. Edi ji m bahke jolo, ń nehm ma ba?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aya ma elkpin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Esꞌkohro efung bi elkak nio, bi bi jolo egburu efung. Owo Jisos kehm mehle yiimi, kehm bungu wahre wahre re, “Nne awohng awohng no alahb lꞌkor-e, nong á ba ga egame, ba wo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 22:17</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ana wo nwer Esowo bungu no re, ‘Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-m, aya ma elkpin bahke kehme elfabe go ege eltim lohng.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:14</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Jisos bungu ellum nia bade etohko ji ane ba lꞌtaame tv-e bahke bele. Tibre ngare nyio etohko ji Esowo ka ba, eji Jisos kala nyahme go elkv song ji go ege ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:7; Elt 2:1-4</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane yabe no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Eji ane bao wuku alum nyao, egom jindiki kehm bungu re, “Nne noa ana lohko li nnyehnamahr Esowo noo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:21,45</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Egom jindiki jo bungu re, “Nne noa ana, Kraist wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Egom jindiki jo bahbe re, “Anv, Kraist bahke lohngo go Galilia? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Nwer Esowo bungu re, ‘Kraist bahke lohngo go etꞌtohngo ji Devid. Bo bahk-e jele go Betlehem, ejahbe ji Devid.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 2:1; Luk 2:4-7</char></note><figure style="fig" file="bk00361c.tif" size="col" loc="John 7: 42" ref="7:42">Betlehem Ngare Atv</figure><verse eid="JHN 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Owo ane bao kehm kehme elyabe tib go ege esi. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Egom jindiki jo sebe re bo bob-e, jol nnene jolem, no lak-e abo.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekꞌtaame ji atubesi Jus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Alokeltum bao kehm feere ebo, tahm goji Bab Farisi, a atubesi abalimajom. Bo kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń ki-e bob, ba a ne?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Alokeltum bao kehm faange re, “Nnene limm, no kpo bung ana nne noo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:28-29; Jon 18:6</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bab Farisi kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, wahn fvfo, á kp-n tob nehma? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Wahn ebtiki nyehn ntubesi awohng awohng, a nne a Farisi no ma tiki taame tv-ea?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:18-31</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ellong ane bao nehme kahn atahm nya Moses. Owo wahng ka erakatahng ji Esowo li a bo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nekodimos ji ma tohko je goji Jisos, ji woomo go ellong Farisis kehm bungu re,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:1; 19:39</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Atahm enyahre bungu re, wahr kꞌjo lam na lam nne, eji e kala wuk, fere seb kahn ji á limi no.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bo kehm faange re, “Anv, wo tob lohng go Galili fvfoa? Lung nwer Esowo, a bahke kahne re, nnyehnamahr awohng awohng limm, no bahke lohngo go Galili.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ane kpee kehm yaame kehnge.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Nnenkal no bo bob-e no, eji á jo lim erehbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Jisos kehm tahme go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Efungfu atv atv á kehm kpe feere ba go etahk Esowo. Ane kpee kehm kame ba rur senng-e kak. Á kehm jehke, jo tib bo.<verse eid="JHN 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm kehm koko mmonankal awohng ba a ne, no bo bob-e no, eji á jo lim erehbe, ko-e song yiimi go esamahr ane kpee. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bo kehm tongo Jisos re, “Ntꞌtibi, mmonankal noa, e m-e bob, eji á jo lim erehbe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Go egahre atahm, Moses tong-r re, elkohn nnenkal noo, wahr jo wul-e na go atal atal. Anv, a bahke bungu renan bada ne?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Alum nyao, bo bungu, eji bo lꞌgar-e. Bo jo sebe re, bo bel ejum ji bo bahk-e ebi ka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Jisos kehm soro kabe, jo tennge ebnyohkobo go ndi.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Eji bo soro asi, jo bahb-e abahbe, Jisos kehm mehle yiimi, kehm tongo bo re, “Nong, nne awohng awohng go egahne ellong no kala lꞌlim abꞌbi, gbo mbang rod eltal tub-e.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:1; Mat 5:28</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Jisos kehm kpe kabe, kpe kehme ebnyohkobo tennge go ndi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Eji bo wuku ano, bo kehm kehme elyaame, go nne awohng awohng, nnenkul abo wo gbo mbang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:9">Jisos sa ntahngtahng, a nnenkal noo no yiimi o. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jisos kehm tabe esamahr ebe, kehm-e tongo re, “Nnenkal, ane bako bana? Nnene limm, no kp-a kpeke ka ebia?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Á kehm faange re, “Ntul, nnene me kpeem ka ebi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Jol me, wa n nehm tob ka ebi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:17</char></note> Song, ka kpe lim abꞌbi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 9:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li ellennge ni njini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Jisos kehm kpe kehme elbungu a bo re, “Me wo li ellennge ni njini. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtoon-m, á nehm kpe jen go ejannge, á bahke bele ellennge ni elkpin.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bab Farisi kehm-e tongo re, “Eji a kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka elna antahng, ntianse enya limm go etingitingi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Jol afi n kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka elname antahng, ntianse enyame lohko li go etingitingi. Tibre n kpꞌkahne edi ji n lohng no ba, fere kahn edi ji n fi no. Wahn nehme kahn edi ji n lohng no ba, jol ń nehme tob kahn edi ji n fi no. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ń kpo lam alam ana ane kpo lam, wo, me n kpehme lam nnene. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Li re n kpꞌlame ane, kehn elam ejame li go etingitingi. Tibre me ntahngtahng sang kpo lam. E kpo lam awahr a Nsoo no tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Bo nyꞌnyon go egahne atahm re, ane abal lꞌyiimi ntianse, bung nnyo amehng, lohngo re, alum nya bo bungu no lohko li etingitingi. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />N kpo yiimi ntianse ka elname antahng. Nsoo no tum-m no kpo tob yiimi ntianse ka-m fvfo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:7-11; 9:7</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Owo bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Nsoo li gan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Jisos kehm faange bo re, “M-e ń nehme kahnem. Nsoo, we ń nehme tob kahn. Li re ń kp-m kahne, kehn wahn ebtob kahn Nsoo fvfo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Jisos jo bungu alum nyaa, eji á jo tib go etahk Esowo, edi ji bo kpo kuuru akpohko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:20">Nnene jolem, no bob-e no, tibre ngare enye ka rehng.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ń nehm ma je edi ji n fi no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Jisos kehm kpe tong bo re, “M bahke tahme, ḿ bahk-m sebe. Ngare nyio wo ḿ bahke kpoko go egahne abiafem. Edi ji n fi no, ń nehm ma ba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:34; 13:33; 14:28</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Jus kehm bahbe re, “Anv, á bahke wulu na elnea, tib eji á kpꞌbungu re, edi ji á fi no, wahr nehm ma jea?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Wahn lohng go njini nyia. Me n lohng go ero ba. Wahn li ka njini nyia. Me n limm ka njini nyia. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />M ma-n tong re, ḿ bahke kpoko go egahne abiafem. Tohko tiki jol re, ń taame na tv re, me nne noo wo, ḿ bahke kpoko go egahne abiafem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:18</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Wo nne awo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Li ana m ma-n tohko tong mboma mbomo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />N kpi nsol gbalee nyi m bahke bungu bada nahne, fere lam-n. Nne no tum-m no li go etingitingi. Ajehng ajehng ji n wuku go ege, ji ji n kpꞌlennge ka njini nyia.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Tikem lennge bo re, Jisos jo bungu bada Nde.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Ngare nyi ḿ ma rod Mmon no nne, kum go ejangnti, rod jahm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:14; 12:32-33</char></note> owo ḿ bahke kahne re, me nne noo wo, fere kahn re ejumjum limm, ji n kpo lim go egame eko. N kpo bung ana Nsoo tong-m no. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Nsoo no tum-m no li a name. M-e á ka tahm sa. Tibre n kpo lim ji kpo kor-e ngare anyehng anyehng.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Eji Jisos bungu alum nyaa, ane gbalee tꞌtaame tv-e.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade aforfor ane, a aju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Jisos kehm bungu tong aneb Jus ba ma taame tv-e re, “Ń lꞌsoro asi ana, jo toono alum enyame, ḿ bahke lohko jol atingitingi abatꞌtoono ebame. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ḿ bahke kahne etingitingi. Etingitingi bahk-n limi, ń for.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Wahr lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Ebraham. E ka jol a jol aju ka nne awohng awohng. Jen ji wahnge a kehm bungu re, bo bahk-r limi, e for?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:9</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim abiafem, á li nju ka abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:16</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Nju kpehme jol etahk nde ngare kpe kpe. Mmon a nde nne wo kpo jol etahk nde ngare kpe kpe. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mmon no Esowo lꞌlim-n re wahn for, wahn eblohko for go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:18</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />N kpꞌkahne re, wahn lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Ebraham, gana ń kpꞌsebe re wahn wul-m. Tibre ń nehme ko alum enyame nya n kp-n tibi, kak go egahna ntim. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />N kpo bung jio ji n nyehne goji Nsoo. Wahn kpo lim ji ń wuku goji nso ejahne.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Ebraham wo li nso ejahre.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Li re ń li abon ba Ebraham, kehn ń kpꞌlimi ji Ebraham limi no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:7</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Anv a, ń kpꞌsebe re wahn wul-m, me ji li nne no kp-n tongo etingitingi ji n wuku goji Esowo. Nsol ana nyia Ebraham joom lim. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ń kpo lim nsol nyi nso ejahne limi no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Bo kehm-e faange re, “Wahr limm abon ba ki nyi babnde. Wahr kpi nde na awohng no li Esowo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Li re Esowo nso ejahne wo, kehn n kp-n koro. Tibre n lohngo goji Esowo ba. Ye wo tum-m no. M baam go egama ngang antahng. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Jen ji wahnge alum nya n kpꞌbungu kil-n ellennge? Tibre wahn nehme kor re, wahn wuungu atung go egame alum. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Wahn li abon ba nnehm nyi nso ejahne. Ń kpꞌsebe re wahn toono mbang nyi nso ejahne. Á jolo nwulane go mboma mbomo. Ye, a etingitingi, bo kpehme koono. Etingitingi ajehng ajehng á kpimm. Á lꞌkim efahnge, á kpꞌlimi ana eljini ene li no. Tibre ye nkimfahnge nyi. Afahnge kpee lohng go ege.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:8-10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />“N kpo tong-n etingitingi, owo wahng ka ń kil taame tv-m. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nne awo go egahne ellong bahk-m tibi ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng ji m ma lim?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:21; 1 Pit 2:22</char></note> N lꞌtong-n etingitingi, jen ji wahng ka ń kil taame tv-m? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Nne no lohng goji Esowo, ye wo kpo wuk alum nya Esowo. Ejum ji wahnge ń kil wuku alum Esowo, li re, ń limm ka Esowo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos, a Ebraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Jus kehm faange Jisos re, “Anv, e lꞌtong-a re, wo nne a Samaria wo, a kpi ebi etohko go ega atahng, etingitingi sang e kpꞌbunga?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:20; 10:20</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Me, ebi etohko ajehng ajehng n kpimm go egame atahng. Esowo bi li Nsoo. Ye wo n kpo kak-e. Wahn, m-e nehme kak. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />N nehme seb ellub nꞌname antahng. Nne noa go, no kp-m ellub ka. Ye wo li nlꞌlame. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌbum alum enyame, á nehm kpe tiki kpo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Jus kehm-e tongo re, “Anv, wahr eblohko kahn re, a kpi ebi etohko go ega atahng. Tibre Ebraham kpꞌkpo, ano wo fvfo abanyehnamahr Esowo tob kpo, gana a kp-r fere tong re, nne no lꞌbum alum enya, á nehm kpe tiki kpo. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Anv, wo wo ga gbal sehnge Ebraham, nso ejahre no ma kpoa? Abanyehnamahr Esowo fvfo tꞌtob kpo. Anv, a kpꞌtiri re, wo elkohn nne awo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jisos kehm faange re, “N lꞌka elname ellub antahng, ellub ename li mbol mbol. Nsoo wo kpo ka-m ellub, ye ji ń kpꞌtongo re, Esowo ebahne bi. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />We ń ka tiki kahn. Me n kp-e kahne. N lꞌtong re, me, we n nehme kahn, n li nkimfahnga nne ana wahn. N kp-e kahne kpee, fere jo bum alum enye. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ebraham, nso ejahne, eltim jo yeb-e sehng re, afung enyame kpir-e. Á nyꞌnyehn, fere bel eyebatahng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:30-31</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Jus kehm-e tongo re, “Jol nnya atahl abal a nnya ewubu a ka kang, gana a kpꞌbungu re, wobnyehn Ebraham!”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Re Ebraham kehm jini, me n noa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Owo bo kehm fohko atal re bo tuub-e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:59">Jisos kehm beke, biiri eje etahk Esowo o, fere lohng eje tahm.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nwakamahr, á nyehn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Eji Jisos jo sehng go mbang, á kehm nyehne nne no bo jel-e nwakamahr.<verse eid="JHN 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntꞌtibi, ye wo limi abiafema, afi nde abola nnyehn ba limi abiafem, ji wahng ka bo kehm-e jele ano?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:1-5</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jisos kehm faange bo re “Lohngem re abiafem nya nne noa nya, jol nya nde, a nnyehn sang. Jia li, eji ane lꞌnyehn nkpokosi nyi Esowo bahke limi go ege elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />E bahke tiki jo lim eltum ni nne no tum-m no, eji njul kpeke li. Tibre atv bahke behde, ma nnene lꞌkꞌkpe ma lim eltum. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Me wo li ellennge ni njini, eji n kpeke li go njini.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Á bungu kan ano me, á kehm soro so atel wohngo ndi, nyob ndi, roongo nne noo go amahr, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />kehm-e tongo re, “Song, wo song ru esamahr eba go eto ji Siloam!” (ji lohngo re “eltumu”).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:7">Nwakamahr nyio kehm soro tahm, song ru esamahr ebe, soro nyehn, kehm feere ba.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Aneb ebjing ebe, a ane ba jo nyehn-e, eji á jo ji, jo gboongo nsol, kehm kehme elbungu re, “Nne noa sang ana, no kpo kono eljehke, jo gboongo nsola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Egom jindiki jo bungu re, “Ye wo ana.” Egom jindiki re, “Ye sang, á kp-e foongo na.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Yefono antahng kehm kehme elbungu re, “Me wo ana.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bo kehme bahbe re, “Anv, á limi renan, amahr enya kehm lennge?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Á kehm faange re, “Nne no bo kpo lung-e re Jisos, ye wo nyobo ndi, roong-m go amahr, kehm-m tongo re, ‘Song go eto ji Siloam, wo song ru esamahr!’ Owo n kehm lohko tahm, song ru esamahr, lohko nyehn.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, nne noo li gan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Á kehm faange re, “Me n nehme kahno!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Bab Farisi jo bahb abahbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bo kehm soro ko nne noo no tohko wa amahr, tahm a ne goji Bab Farisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Efung bi Jisos nyobo edob, fere lim nne noo amahr enye lennge, jolo efung Esabat.<verse eid="JHN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Bab Farisi kehm-e kpe bahb ana limi lim, á kehm nyehne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:15">Á kehm tongo bo re, “Á roong-m edob go amahr, n kehm song ru esamahr, soro nyehn.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Egom Farisi jindiki kehm bungu re, “Nne no limi ejum jia, á lohngem goji Esowo, tibre á nehme bum ntahm nyi Esabat.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Egom jindiki jo bungu re, “Bahke jolo renan re, nne no li nne abiafem, kehm ma lim akpokosi ana nyaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ane bao kehm kehme elyabe.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Owo bo kehm kpe bahb nwakamahr a nne noo no ma nyehn re, “Anv, a kpo bung renan bada ne, eji á ma-a lim amahr enya ma lennge, a ma nyehn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Nne noo kehm faange re, “Nnyehnamahr wo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Jus tikem taame re, nne noo lꞌlohko wa amahr, á ma fere nyehn, tete bo lung nde, a nnyehn nne no ma nyehn, bo ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bo kehm bahbe bo re, “Mmon ewahne wo aa, no ń kpo bung re, ń jel-e nwakamahra? Á limi renan, kehm nyehne?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Nde, a nnyehn kehm faange re, “E kpꞌkahne re, mmon ewahre wo a, no e jel-e nwakamahr. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ana á ma fere nyehn anv, e nehme kahn ana limi lim, á kehm nyehne. E nehme kahn nne no lenng-e amahr. Bahben ye, yebgbal, á bahke ma faange antahng.”<verse eid="JHN 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Nde, a nnyehn bungu alum nyaa, tibre bo jo fahle Jus. Tib Jus bungu bum nnyo amehng re, nne awohng awohng no lꞌsi bꞌbung re, Jisos, Mesaya wo, bo bahk-e kame yehke go ero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:42; 7:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Esi jio ji wahng ka nde, a nnyehn tongo re, “Yebgbal, bahben ye!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bab Farisi kehm kpe lung nne noo no bo jel-e nwakamahr, kehm-e tongo re, “Ka Esowo ellub! E kpꞌkahne re, nne noo, nne abiafem wo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Á kehm faange re, “Ma nne noo nne abiafem wo nji. Me n nehme kahn. Ejum ajehng ji n kpꞌkahne, li re, n jolo nwakamahr, anv, me n nyehn.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, á lim-a renan? Á limi renan, kehm lennge amahr enya?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Á kehm faange bo re, “M ma-n tohko tong wuku wuku, ń wuungem atung. Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌsebe re, me n kpe-n tong, wahn kpe wuk? Anv, ń kpꞌsebe re wahn tob jol abatꞌtoono ebea?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bo kehm-e suku re, “Wo wo li ntꞌtoono ewe, go, wahr abatꞌtoono ba Moses ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />E kpꞌkahne re, Esowo jo bungu a Moses. Nne noo, wahr nehme kahn edi ji á lohng no ba.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Á kehm kpe faange re, “Anv, ejum jia nkpokosi sanga? Ń nehme kahn edi ji á lohng no, gana yeblennge amahr enyame. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />E kpꞌkahne re, Esowo kpehme wuungu aneb abiafem atung. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌkak-e, fere lim mbang enye, ye wo Esowo kpo wuung-e atung. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Bomo go mbomannahb nyi njini bomo no tete rehng anv, nnene limm, no ma wꞌwuk re, nne noa, no ma lꞌlennge amahr nne no bo jel-e nwakamahr. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Li re nne noo lohngem goji Esowo, kehn á jolem ma lim ejumjum.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Bo jel-a go abiafem, a ejannge, anv, a kpꞌsebe re wo tib-ra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:34">Bo kehm soro kam-e yehke go ero bio.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade amahr awake nya etohko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Jisos kehm wuku re, bo m-e kam yehke go ero. Eji á song nyehn-e, á kehme bahbe re, “Wobtaame tv Mmon no nnea?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Á kehm faange re, “Nsoo, nne awo m bahke taame tv-e?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jisos kehm bungu tong-e re, “A m-e nyehn. Ye wo ana, kpꞌbungu a na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:26</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Á kehm faange re, “Ntul, me n taame,” fere gbo jamm-e alahng.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Esi elam jio ji wahnge m ba go njini nyia, eji ane ba kil elnyehne lꞌnyehn, eji ane bao ba kpꞌnyehne lꞌfere wa amahr.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Egom Farisi jindiki ji jolo kohl-e, kehm wuku, bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, wahr tob li awakamahra?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Li re wahn ebwa amahr, kehn ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng a nahne limm. Anv, eji ń kpꞌtongo re, ‘E kpꞌnyehne,’ ebi jia, a nahne.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:22,24</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada mbaabebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Jisos kehm kpe tong bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne awohng awohng no tohko yel go mbutahk mi etahk ejoro, á lꞌfere wahr edi jindiki yel, nne noo ona nwajv nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:10-11; 4:17; 5:11-12; 6:12-13</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Nne no lꞌyel go mbutahk,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:20</char></note> ye wo li mbaabebul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:11</char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd" file="bk00004c.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 10.2" copy="Louise Bass" ref="10:2">Mbaabebul</figure> <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ye wo, nne no kpo baabe mbu bahke lennge ka-e, á yel. Ejoro ebe kpo wuk ellum ene. Á kpo lung ejoro ebe go bo abing, fere lohng a bo. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Á lꞌyehke bo kpee, á kpo fere gbo bo mbang, ejoro jo toon-e go njahm. Tibre bo kpꞌliingi ellum ene. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Njenne, bo we nehm toono. Bo bahk-e beke na, yaam-e sa. Tibre alum ajenne, bo nehme liingi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Eji Jisos tubu bo elgan nia, bo kahnem ejum ji á jo tꞌtong bo.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li nnooba mbaabebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Jisos kehm kpe tong bo re, “Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:7">“Me wo li mbutahk mi ejoro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Egom jehko kpee ji gbo mbang ba ka me, awajv nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:14,29-31; 2 Kor 11:20</char></note> Ejoro joom wuungu bo atung. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Me wo li mbutahk. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌyel go mbutahk mio, á bahke bele eltahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 4:12</char></note> Á bahke yele, fere lohng, song li efa. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Nwajv kpo ba re á ba v, fere wul, fere rꞌrannge. Me m ba re me m ba ka bo elkpin budu sahb gbꞌgbal.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Me wo li nnooba mbaabebul, nnooba mbaabebul no bahke kake elkpin ene go esi ejoro ebe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Nne no bo lak-e na, no ki li nfono ejoro, á lꞌnyehn ebi nnyam kpꞌbake, á bahke beke, ejoro bio sa. Ebi nnyam nyio bahke bake, ba bob ejoro bindiki, behko yaame ebo kpee. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Nne noo bahke beke, tibre bo lak-e na, á nehme tiiri ejoro bio.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Me wo li nnooba mbaabebul. N kpꞌkahne ejoro bꞌbame, ejoro ebame kp-m tob kahn. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ana Nsoo kp-m kahne, ano wo fvfo n kpꞌtob kahn Nsoo. Me n yake elkpin ename ka go esi ejoro ebame. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />N kpi ejoro bindiki, bi ki wob go ellong nia. Bo fvfo, m bahke tob ko bo ba. Bo bahke wuku alum enyame, fere jol ellong anehng, a mbaabebul awohng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:52; Ef 2:14</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ana wo wahnge n kpꞌkoro Nsoo, tibre me n yake elkpin ename ka, goji n lꞌfere kpe ko elkpin ename.<verse eid="JHN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />“Nnene limm, no bahke ma taare elkpin ename, sehngem re no, n ka na antahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:53</char></note> N kpi nsahm nyi m bahke yake elkpin ename ka, fere bel nsahm nyi m bahke fere ko elkpin ename. Tibre ano wo Nsoo tong-m re me n lim.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Jus kehm kpe kehme elyabe, tib go alum nyao nya Jisos bungu no.<verse eid="JHN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Egom Jus gbalee jo bungu re, “Á kpi ebi etohko go ege atahng. Yebgbo esahl. Jen ji wahnge ń kp-e wuungu atung?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Egom jindiki jo bungu re, “A alum nya nne no kpi ebi etohko sang. Anv, ebi etohko bahke ma lennge nwakamahr amahra?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana aneb Jus tene Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Elkak nio ni elbuumu ni bo kpe lennge etahk Esowo jolo go Jeusalem. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ngare nyio jolo ngare elkoko. Jisos jo yannge go nlaaga nyi etahk Esowo, edi ji bo jo lung re etahk Solomon. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Jus kehm kame ba rur senng-e kak, kehm-e bahbe re, “Bahke kpe kang renan, a kehm-r tongo? Wahr ga li-r ekpehlekpehle. Joare wo Mesaya wo, lennge tong-r.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “M ma-n tohko tong, ń nehme taame. Ntum nyi n kpꞌlimi go mbing nyi Nsoo, nyi nyi kpꞌyiimi ntianse ka-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:36</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Wahn nehme taame, tibre ń wobem go ellong ejoro ebame.<verse eid="JHN 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />“Ejoro ebame kpo wuk alum enyame. N kpꞌkahne bo, bo kp-m toono. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />N kpo ka bo elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Bo nehm tiki kpo tan. Nnene limm, no bahke ma fooro bo go egame abo, tahm a bo. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Nsoo no ka-m bo, gbale sehnge nne awohng awohng. Nnene limm, no bahke ma fooro bo go ebo bi Nsoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Wahr awahr a Nsoo, e li ajehng.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Owo Jus kehm kpe fohko atal re bo tuub-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:59</char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Me n lim nnoobo gbalee ka-n, nnoobo nyi Nsoo ka-m no re me n lim. Go nsol nyia kpee, ekahmekahme ejum aji wahnge ń kpꞌsebe re, wahn tuub-m atal?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Jus kehm-e faange re, “E nehme seb re, wahr tuub-a atal tib go nnoobo nyi a kpꞌlimi. E kpꞌsebe re, wahr tuub-a atal tib eji a kpꞌsuku Esowo, eji a kpꞌrodo elna, jo bum ana Esowo, wo ji li na nne.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:65</char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Bo nyono go egahne atahm re, ‘Esowo re, wahn li are Esowo bi.’<verse eid="JHN 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />“E kpꞌkahne re, ji nwer Esowo bungu no, nnene limm, no bahke ma range alum nya Esowo. Esowo kpo lung ane bao ba á ka bo alum enye re, ‘Esowo’, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />jen ji wahnge ń kp-m tongo re, n kpꞌsuku Esowo, tib eji n tong-n re, me Mmon Esowo wo, me ji Esowo Nsoo yehke no, fere tum tv go njini nyia? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />N tohko lim eltum ni Nsoo, kana taame tv-m! <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />N lꞌfere lim eltum ni Nsoo, ń tohko taame tv-m, lub taamen tv eltum ni n kpꞌlimi, eji ń lꞌkahn, fere taame re, Nsoo noa, wob-m go atahng, me n tob wob Nsoo go atahng.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bo kehm kpe gare re bo bob-e, Jisos kehm weele eje be. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Á kehm feere song siiri Jodan, song kang eje go egbuk jehko, edi jio ji Jon gbo mbang jo wohngo ane alahb.<verse eid="JHN 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ellong ane gbalee kehm bake go ege, kehm ba bung re, “Jol eji Jon ki lꞌlim nkpokosi anyehng anyehng, ejum ajehng ajehng ji á bungu no bada nne noa eblohko jol go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:29-34</char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ane tvv tꞌtaame tv-e edi jio o.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Ana Lasaros kpo no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Nne awohng jolo gona, no bo jo lung-e re Lasaros ji jo yam. Á lene go Betani, ejahbe ji Meri lene no, a Mata mmonannyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:38-39</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Meri jio wo yaange akehng ma nno a nno wohngo Ntul a Jisos, fere ko alv esi enye dohk-e akpade.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:3</char></note> Ye wo, Lasaros mmonannyehn jo yam.<verse eid="JHN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Abonanyehn Lasaros bao kehm tiingi etib tv Jisos re, “Ntul, ekpondahme eja ji kpo kor-a sꞌsehng kpꞌyame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:7</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Eji Jisos wuku no, á kehm bungu re, “Eyam bio, eyam elkv sang, li re Esowo tib ellub ene, eji Mmon Esowo lꞌbel ellub.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:3</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Jisos, Mata jo kor-e sehng, a Meri mmonannyehn, go Lasaros. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Jisos wuku kan re, Lasaros kpꞌyame, á kpe kang nfung ebal edi jio ji á jolo no. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Owo á kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Ba, wahr feeren go Judea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e tongo re, “Ntꞌtibi, nyanjehle Jus jo sebe re bo tuub-a atal, anv ana, a kpꞌkpeke seb re wo kpe feere goa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:31,39</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ewubu awa na abal sang li go efung kohro kohra? Nne awohng awohng no lꞌjen ngara njul, á kpehme seele. Tibre á kpꞌnyehne ellennge ni njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:5</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌjen go ejannge, á kpo sꞌseele. Tibre ellennge go ege atahng limm.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ana wo Jisos bungu no, kehm kpe soro asi bung tong bo re, “Lasaros, nte ewahre kpꞌlale. N kpꞌtahme song nyahm-e.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e tongo re, “Ntul, lꞌjol re Lasaros kpꞌlale na, eyam ebe bahk-e tele.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Jisos bungu bade elkv ni Lasaros. Bo jo tiri re, Jisos bungu bade ellu nehka nehka ni nne kpo lal. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Owo Jisos kehm lennge tong bo re, “Lasaros ebkpo. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Esi ejahne ji wahnge eltim kp-m yebe, eji n ki jol ona, eji ń lꞌtaame. Nong, wahr tahmen go!”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomos ji bo jo lung-e re Ayafele, kehm tongo abatꞌtoono Jisos bako re, “Nong, wahr tob tahmen toon-e, eji afi jolo elkv, e lꞌtob kpo a ne a ne.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li enyahme ngubjing go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Eji Jisos ba no, á sebe kahn re, Lasaros, bo m-e kak elahm, ebkang nfung eni. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Tahm go Betani rehng go Jeusalem labem, jolo mmal na ebal. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Jus gbalee ji ba no re bo ba ji, jo kak Mata, a Meri eltim, tib go elkv ni mmonannyehn ebo ma kpo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Eji Mata wuku re, Jisos kpꞌbake, á kehm tahme song wan-e. Meri ji eje ga etahk. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mata kehm tongo Jisos re, “Ntul, li re, a jolo jol ana, kehn mmonannee jolem kpoko. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Jol anv, n kpꞌkahne re, ejum ajehng ajehng ji a lꞌbahb Esowo, á bahk-a kake.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Mmonanne bahke nyahme go elkv.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mata kehm-e tongo re, “N kpꞌkahne re, á bahke nyahme go elkv go esꞌkohro efung bi ane kpee bahke nyahme.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:29</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Me wo li enyahme ngubjing go elkv. Me wo li elkpin. Nne no lꞌtaame tv-m, afi á kpo na, á bahke fere jol go elkpin. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Nne no lꞌjol go elkpin, fere taame tv-m, á nehm kpe tiki kpo ekpokokpoko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:14; 21:4</char></note> Wobtaame ana n tong-a noa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Á kehm-e faange re, “Ee Ntul, me n taame re, wo wo li Kraist ji Mmon no Esowo no bo tong-r re, á kpꞌbake go njini.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lingi no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Eji Mata bungu ano mal, á kehm tahme song lung Meri mmonannyehn, kehm-e tongo go awꞌwa re, “Ntꞌtibi ebba, á kp-a lungu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Meri wuku kan ano me, á kehm mehle tahm re, á song kpir-e. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ngare nyio o Jisos ka rehng go ejahbe jio, á kpeke yim go edi ji Mata kpir-e no. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Eji anebe Jus ba ji a Meri go ege etahk, jo kak-e eltim, nyehne re, yebmehl fi, bo kehm tob tahm toon-e. Tibre bo jo tiri re, Meri fi song ling go elahm.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Meri ba kan a, ba rehng edi ji Jisos jolo no, á kehm soro nyehn-e, soro gbo jamm-e alahng, kehm bungu tong-e re, “Ntul, li re, a jolo jol ana, kehn mmonannee jolem kpoko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Eji Jisos nyehn-e no, á kpꞌlingi, fere nyehn Jus ji toon-e no ba, kpꞌtob ling, owo ndon kehm-e fili go eltim, fere moong-e go atahng.<verse eid="JHN 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Á kehm-e bahbe re, “Gan wo ń kak-e no?” Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Ntul, ba wahr tahm, wo ba nyehn!”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jisos kehm lingi.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Owo Jus kehm bungu re, “Nyehnen ana á kp-e korae!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Egom ane bandiki jo bungu re, “Ye sang lennge nwakamahr amahra? Anv, á jolem ma lim nne noa, á kꞌkpoa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Lasaros nyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Jisos, ndon kehme kpe gbal go eltim. Á kehm bake go elahm. Elahm bio o, bo rahme go ekpartal, fere bannge eltal bulu go nnyo elahm.<verse eid="JHN 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Banngen eltal nio, wahn bum go nkpe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Mata ji mmonannyehn nkvne kehm-e tongo re, “Ntul, á bahke vohko tꞌtokko sehng, tibre ebkang nfung eni nyi á kpo no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 14:30-31</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Wa n tongem re, a lꞌtaame, a bahke nyehne ellub ni Esowoa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Owo bo kehm bannge eltal nio bum go nkpe. Jisos kehm kpiidi amahr go ero, kehm bungu re, “Nsoo, m ma-a kak saam, tibre a ma-m wuk. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />N kpꞌkahne re, a kpo wuk-m ngare anyehng anyehng. M bungu jia tib go esi ji ane baa ba yim a, eji bo lꞌtaame re, wo wo lohk-m tum.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:30</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Jisos bungu kan ano me, á kehm rabe wahre wahre re, “Lasaros, lohng me!”<verse eid="JHN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Nne no kpo no, kehm soro lohng go elahm, a abomo nya bo kpenng-e no go abo, a akpade akpade. Esamahr ebe, bo tob kpenng-e mbomo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Fanngen ye, wahn yak-e, á song!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 6:1; Jems 5:20</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jo lam kak Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Jus gbalee ji ba no, ba ji a Meri, fere nyehn ji Jisos limi no, bo soro taame tv-e.<verse eid="JHN 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Egom jindiki kehm tahme goji Bab Farisi, song tooro tong bo ana ji Jisos ma lim.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Owo atubesi abalimajom, a Bab Farisi kehm lungu atubesi nfam, bo ba kono edi ajehng. Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, e bahke limi renan, tib eji nne noa kpꞌlimi akpokosi gbalee? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />E lꞌyak-e, á lꞌsoro asi ana, nne awohng awohng bahke taame tv-e. Anebe Rom bahke bake, ba rannge ejahbe ejahre, fere rannge mbarebare etahk Esowo jia.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Nne awohng no tob woomo go ellong ane bao, no bo jo lung-e re Kayafas ji jolo ntubesi abalimajom go elya nio, kehm bungu tong bo re, “Ń nehme tohko kꞌkahn ejumjum. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ń nehme kahn re, nobo re, nne awohng kpo, tib go esi ane kpee, sehnge re ejahbe kohro kohro rannga?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:14</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Alum nya á bungu no, á bungem go ege a ntir. Tib eji á jolo ntubesi abalimajom, owo wahnge á nyehne amahr nya Esowo re, nobo re Jisos kpo go esi ejahbe kohro kohro. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Lohngem re ejahbe Jus ji ji, fvfo tob li ka abon Esowo ba ma yaame rur go njini, eji bo lꞌfere jol ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:16; Ef 3:6</char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Bomo efung bio asongo, owo bo toobo no ana bo bahk-e wulu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Owo wahnge Jisos ki kpe jo jen gbul gbul gbuul, jo yannge go Judea. Á jo tahme ona, song rehng go ejahbe ji li kohlo elka emahng, ji bo jo lung re Efraim. Owo á jolo no eje, a abatꞌtoono ebe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ngare nyio elkak ni Jus ni Pasova ebkabbe. Ane gbalee jo tahme ajahbe nyako, jo je go Jeusalem, eji bo lꞌsong bum elbo saang, elkak nio kehm rehnge. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bo jo sebe Jisos. Eji bo song kono asi go etahk Esowo, bo kehm kehme elbahbe atemtem re, “Anv, ń kpꞌtiri renan? Á nehm ba go elkak niaa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ngare nyio nyi atubesi abalimajom, a Bab Farisi kehm tongo re, nne awohng awohng no lꞌkahn edi ji Jisos li no, á ba tong bo, eji bo lꞌje, song bob-e.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo wohngo Jisos akehng go Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Eji ma sa nfung erakera, Pasova rehng, Jisos kehm tahme go Betani, edi ji Lasaros lene no, ji á nyahme go elkv. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Owo bo kehm lame nsol ka-e. Mata wo jo loko bo. Lasaros tꞌtob woomo go ellong ane ba ji ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke a Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Meri kehm koko egburu elom akehng ji sahb kꞌkim ekun, ba a ji, ba yaange wohngo Jisos go akpade, kehm fere ko alv esi enye, jo dohk-e akpade.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:2; Luk 10:39</char></note> Esꞌsvv akehng mao kehm yeele na yeele ekpꞌkpa jio.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Judas Iskariot ji woomo go ellong abatꞌtoono Jisos, ye jio ji bahk-e gungu, kehm bungu re, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Jen ji wahnge bo ki gungu akehng maa, ko eltahl a mpon ewubu ka akpak?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Alum nyaa nya á bungu no, lohngem re á tiiri akpak, lohngo re á tiiri elne. Tibre ye jolo nwajv. Á jolo nne no jo kuuru akpohko, fere jo yehke o, jo kak elne ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 8:3</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Yaken nnenkal noo! Á kuuru akehng maa sik elkv ename. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Akpak li a nahne ngare anyehng anyehng, wo, me n limm a nahne ngare anyehng anyehng.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jo lam kak Lasaros</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Eji ellong Jus tvv wuku no re, Jisos li o, bo kehm jeke. Bo jeem tib Jisos wo wo. Bo je re, bo tob song nyehn Lasaros ji Jisos nyahm-e go elkv.<verse eid="JHN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Atubesi abalimajom kehm toobo re, bo tob wul Lasaros fvfo. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Tib go ege esi wo wahnge egom Jus gbalee jo yake bo, fere jo taame tv Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yele go Jeusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Etoono efung behko ellong ane gbalee ba, ba go elkak kehm wuku re, Jisos kpꞌbake go Jeusalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Owo bo kehm jake amang mbohng, tahm a nya re bo song wan-e. Bo kehm kehme elrabe re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Tehken Esowo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Elfuulu li a nne no kpꞌbake go mbing nyi Jehova.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Elfuulu li a ntul no Israel!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Jisos nyehne mmombvankang no nse, kehm kuumu, ana bo nyono go nwer Esowo re,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Ka kpe fahl Jeusalem, mmon a Sayon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Nyehn, ntul ewa kpꞌbake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">á kun go mmombvankang no nse.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Abatꞌtoono ebe wakem lennge bo ngare nyio. Eji Jisos ma bel ellub ene, owo bo kehm buumu re, edi nwer Esowo jio ji bo nyono bada Jisos. Eblohko jol ano ka-e.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Ellong ane ba jolo o ngare nyi á lungu Lasaros go elahm, fere nyahm-e go elkv, bo ba yiimi Jisos ntianse. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Owo wahnge ellong ane kame no re bo ba kpiri Jisos, tibre bo wuku re, ye wo ma lim nkpokosi nyio.<verse eid="JHN 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Bab Farisi kehm bungu atemtem re, “Ń kpꞌnyehne re, ń nehm ma lim ejumjum. Nyehnen ana njini kpee ma tahm kp-e toono.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:22; 11:48,53</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana aneb Grik bandiki jo seb Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Anebe Grik bandiki woomo go ellong ni ane ba je elkak go Jeusalem re bo song kak Esowo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Anebe Grik bao kehm bake goji Filip ji lohng go Betsaida ji Galili,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:43</char></note> kehm ba tong-e re, “Nsoo, e kpꞌsebe re wahr nyehn Jisos.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 2:2</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filip kehm tahme song tong Andru. Andru abola Filip, bo kehm tahme ano, song tong Jisos.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ngare ebrehng nyi Mmon no nne, bo bahk-e egburu ellub ka. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Tohko tiki jol re mmohk eti fooro na gbo go ndi kpo, bahke sake ano ano. Lꞌkpo, bahke kabe akab gbalee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:9</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Nne no elkpin ene lꞌkor-e, á kpꞌtane na elkpin ene. Nne no elkpin ene lꞌsab-e go njini nyia, á kpꞌkuuru na elkpin ene bum go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:39; Luk 17:33</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtong re á kp-m loko, á bahk-m tiki toono. Edi ji n li no, owo nlokeltum ewame bahke tob jol. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlok-m, á bahke jo lub Nsoo.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jo bung bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Anv, eltim ename kp-m gbiingi. M bahke bungu renan a? Lꞌli re me m bung re, ‘Nsoo, tahr-m go ngare nyiaa?’ Eꞌee, jꞌnehm ana ji wahnge m ba no re me m ba nyehn erem ngare nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:38-39</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Nsoo, lim, goji mbing enya lꞌbel ellub!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Bo kehm soro wuk ellum go ejahbetul Esowo ni bungu re, “Me n lim re, mbing enyame bel ellub, m bahke kpe lim, kpe bel ellub.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ellong ane ba yiimi kohlo o wꞌwuk ellum nio. Egom jindiki kehm bungu re, ndan ebta. Egom jindiki bungu re, enjel nyi ma bung a ne.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ellum nia a, ba tib go egahne esi, go egame esi sang wahnge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:42</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Anv wo li ngare nyi njini nyia yim go eti elam. Ngare nyia nyi ntubesi no njini nyia, bo bahk-e kame yake go.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:18; Jon 14:30; 16:11</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ngare nyi bo ma-m kum go ejangnti, rod jahm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:14</char></note> owo m bahke leebe ane kpee tv elname.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:16</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Jisos bungu ellum nia, goji á lꞌtib ane elkohn elkv ni á bahke kpoko.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ellong ane bao kehm-e faange re, “Wahr ebwuk go atahm nya Esowo re, Mesaya bahke jolo go njinanjini. Jen ji wahnge a kehm bungu re, Mmon no nne, bo bahk-e kumu go ejangnti, rod jahm? Nne awo li Mmon no nne?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ellennge nia, li a nahne mmongare ntiil. Jo jenen, eji ellennge kpeke li, goji ejannge lꞌki-n kpiri. Nne no kpꞌjene go ejannge, á kpehme kahn edi ji á fi fi. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Eji ellennge nia, kpeke li a nahne, taamen tv ellennge nia, eji ń lꞌjol abon ba ellennge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:9</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisos bungu kan a mal, á kehm tahme song seb edi biiri, eji bo lꞌki-e nyehn.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jo bung bade ekꞌtaame ji Jus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Jus tikem taame tv Jisos, jol eji á jo lꞌlim akpokosi gbalee, tib bo.<verse eid="JHN 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Jia jolo, tib goji ellum ni nnyehnamahr Aisaya bungu no lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi, ni á bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Ntul, nne awo ma taame tv etib ebahre?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Nne awo no Jehova m-e tib nsahm enye?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 10:16</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Tib go esi alum nyao, bo tikem ma taame. Tibre Aisaya kpe bung re,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Esowo ebwa bo amahr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">fere lim asi ebo tahne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Ki li ano, kehn bo kpꞌnyehne go bo amahr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">fere kahn go bo a ntim, fere sennge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">feere go egame, eji n lꞌlim bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">bo nob.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:14-15</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Aisaya bungu alum nyaa, tibre á nyehne ellub ni Mesaya, fere bung bada ne.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Tvtv o, atubesi Jus gbalee tꞌtaame tv Jisos. Tib eji bo jo fahl Bab Farisi, bo joom bung gbul gbul gbuul, eji bo lꞌkꞌkam bo yehke go ero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:22</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Tibre ellub ni bo kpo ko goji atem, ni ni jo ga kor bo, sehnge ellub ni Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:44</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya Jisos jo bung jolo alum nya elam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Jisos kehm kehme elbungu wahre wahre re, “Nne no lꞌtaame tv-m, á taamem tv me me, á tob taame tv nne no tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Nne no lꞌnyehn-m, yebnyehn nne no tum-m no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:9</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />M ba go njini nyia ba jol ellennge, eji nne awohng awohng no lꞌtaame tv-m, á lꞌkꞌkpe sa go ejannge. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌwuk alum enyame, kꞌfere bum alum nyao, we n nehm lam. Tibre m baam re me m ba lam njini nyia. M ba na re me m ba tahre njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:56</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />“Nne no lꞌten-m, kꞌko alum enyame, ye wo elam nong kp-e siki. Alum nya m ma bung a, nyanehm nya bahk-e lame go esꞌkohro efung. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Tibre alum nya m bungu no, nyanyame sang. Nsoo no tum-m no, ye wo tong-m ji m bahke bungu, fere tib. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />N kpꞌkahne re, alum enye kpo ka elkpin ni li go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:23</char></note> Owo wahng ka n kpo bung ana Nsoo tong-m no re me m bung.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos ru abatꞌtoono ebe akpade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ngare nyio ebsa efung abehng elkak Pasova rehng. Jisos kꞌkahn re, ngare ebbiingi nyi á bahke tahme njini nyia song rehng goji Nde. Ane ba jolo ane ebe go njini nyia, jo kor-e sꞌsehng. Bo jo kor-e tete rehng go esꞌkohro. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Eji Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe jo li nsol, ngare nyio nnehm ebkak Judas Iskariot ji mmon a Saimon ntir go ege eltim re á gungu Jisos. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Jisos kꞌkahn re, Nde m-e kak nsol kpee go ebo. Á jo tob kahne re, á lohng goji Esowo ba, á bahke kpe feere goji Esowo.<verse eid="JHN 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Jisos kehm mehle go ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke yiimi, kehm soro fannge mbomo eme, fere rod ntawehre bobo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Á kehm yaange alahb kak ngbanggbang, jo ru abatꞌtoono ebe akpade, fere jo dohk bo go ntawehre nyi á bobo go ebun.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Á kehm bake goji Saimon Pita. Saimon Pita kehm-e tongo re, “Ntul, anv, a yahk-m ru akpada?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Ji n kpꞌlimi a, a nehme kahn anv, behnjehle go wo bahk-a lennge.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pita kehm-e tongo re, “A nehm tiki ru akpade enyame!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jisos kehm-e faange re, “N tohk-a ru, lohngo re, wo nne ewame sang.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Saimon Pita kehm-e faange re, “Ntul, akpade enyame nya nya sang, a bahk-m ruku. Fvfo, a bahk-m tob ru abo enyame, a esi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nne no ma wuumu alahb, kpeem li re á kpe ru akidi, tibre yebbar kpee,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:3; Gal 3:26</char></note> sehngem re akpade enye nya ano á bahke kpe ru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:7-10</char></note> Wahn ebbar kpee, fvfo, wahn ane kpee sang.”<verse eid="JHN 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Tibre Jisos jo kꞌkahn nne no bahk-e gungu. Owo wahnge á bungu no re, “Wahn ane kpee sang ma bar.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Á ru kan bo akpade mal, á kehm rodo mbomo eme bobo, feere song ji go ege a nji, kehm bahbe bo re, “Ń kpꞌkahne ji n lim-n aa? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ń kpo lung-m re ntꞌtibi, fere lung-m re Ntul. Kpꞌnobo, eji ń kpo lung-m ano. Tibre ano wo n lohko li. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Me wo li ntul ewahne, a ntꞌtibi ewahne. M ma-n ru akpade enyahne. Nobo re wahn fvfo, wahn tob jo ru atemtem akpade.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:27</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />M ma-n tib ntugare, eji wahn fvfo ń lꞌtob lim ana m ma lim ka-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 11:1</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nlokeltum kpehme gbal sehnge nde no á kp-e loko. Ntiingetib awohng awohng limm, no kpo gbal sehnge nde no tum-e no. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Eji ń kpꞌkahne nsol nyia, ń lꞌlim, elfuulu bahke jolo ka-n.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“N nehme bung bade wahn ane kpee. N kpꞌkahne bao ba m ma yehke. Bahke tiki jol go etingitingi ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, ‘Nne no jo li nsol alehke enyame, ye wo jolo nne no ma lam kak-m.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />N kp-n tongo anv ana re kehm limi, eji lꞌlim, ń lꞌtaame re, me nne noo wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:45; 6:14</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌko nne no n tum-e no, á ko me. Nne no lꞌko-m, á tob ko nne no tum-m no.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyehne amahr bade ana bo bahk-e gungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mak 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Jisos bungu kan ano mal, ndon kehm-e gbale go ege atahng. Á kehm kehme elbungu gbul gbul gbuul re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng go egahne ellong bahk-m gungu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm kehme elkeebe, seenge atemtem. Bo joom kahn nne no á jo bꞌbung bada ne.<verse eid="JHN 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ntꞌtoono awohng no Jisos jo kor-e sꞌsehng ji kohlo Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:23; 19:26; 20:2; 21:20,24</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Saimon Pita kehm-e faake ebo, kehm bungu re, “Tong-r nne no á kpꞌbung bada ne.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Owo ntꞌtoono noo kehm jeere kohlo Jisos, kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntul, nne awo me?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Ye ji m bahk-e kake ejum alehke jia ji m bahke tohko go abehne wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:26">Jisos kehm rodo ejum alehke jio, tv abehne, kehm faake ka Judas ji mmon a Saimon Iskariot.<verse eid="JHN 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Eji Jisos ma lim ano, nnehm kehm soro yel Judas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Ejum ji a fi ellimi, song lim elwaare.”<verse eid="JHN 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nnene jolem no ji ekpꞌkuru jio, no kahne ji wahnge Jisos bung ano. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Egom jindiki jo tiri re, eji Judas jo kuuru akpohko, owo wahnge Jisos tong-e no re, á song gunu nsol nyi bo bahke lehke go elkak nio. Egom jindiki tiri re, “Fundiki Jisos tong-e re, á yehke apene song ka akpak.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:6</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Eji Judas ma taare ejum alehke jio, á kehm soro lohng tvtv tahm. Ngare nyio atv ebbehde.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntahm nyi nfenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Eji Judas ma lohng fi, Jisos kehm bungu re, “Anv wo, Mmon no nne ma bel ellub ene. Eji á ma bel ellub, owo Esowo ma tob bel ellub. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Esowo lꞌbel ellub ni Mmon ewe, á bahke kpe feere a ni, ka Mmon ewe. Á bahke limi ano elwaare. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Abon ebame wahn, m bahke gohro jol a nahne mmongare ntiil. Ḿ bahk-m sebe. Ana m bungu tong Jus, ano wo n kp-n tob tong re, Edi ji n fi no, ń nehm ma ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:21</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />N kpꞌjehke ntahm nyi nfenfe ka-n anv re, wahn bel elkoro atemtem. Ana ń kp-m koro, nobo re wahn tob bel elkoro atemtem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:10; 1 Jon 3:11-18</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ń lꞌbel elkoro atemtem, owo ane kpee bahke kahne re, wahn lohko li abatꞌtoono ebame.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyehne amahr bade ana Pita bahk-e tene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Saimon Pita kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Ntul, gan wo a kpꞌtahme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Edi ji n fi no, m-e a nehm ma toono anv. Ngare esꞌsong wo, a bahk-m toono rehng edi jio.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:2-3,28; 21:18-19</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pita kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntul, jen ji wahnge n lꞌki-a ma toono anv? Me n taame re, m bahke kake elkpin ename, kpo go ega esi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Anv, a bahke taame, yake elkpin ena ka go egame esia? Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, a bahke gbaame nkpel era re, me, m-e a nehme kahn, nkok kehm kuku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:27</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li mbang rehng goji Esowo Nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Kana jo taame re, ntim enyahne jo gbiing-n! Taamen tv Esowo, wahn tob taame tv me!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:23</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Go etahk Nsoo akimi nyaa tvv. Tibre n fi song toobo edi bum-n. Ki li ano, kehn wahn n jolem tongo. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />N lꞌje song toobo edi jio bum-n, wo m bahke kpe feere ba, ba ko-n tahm a nahne go edi ji n li no, eji ń lꞌtob jol go edi jio ji n li no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:16-17</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Anv, wahn ebkahn mbang nyi ḿ bahke sehnge rehng go edi ji n fi no.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomos kehm bungu tong-e re, “Ntul, e nehme kahn edi ji a fi no. E bahke limi renan, kehm kahne mbang?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Me wo li mbang, me wo li etingitingi, me wo li elkpin. Nnene limm, no bahke sehnge rehng goji Nsoo, tohko tiki jol re á sehnge go egame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:1-2</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Li re ń kp-m kahne, kehn ń kpꞌtob kahn Nsoo. Bomo anv asongo ń kp-e kahne, tibre ḿ m-e nyehn.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filip kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Ntul, tib-r Esowo Nsoo. Ejum jia ji e kpꞌsebe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Filip, me n jol a nahne afung tvv. M-e a nehme tiki kahna? Nne no lꞌnyehn-m, yebnyehn Esowo Nsoo. Jen ji wahnge a bahke kpe bung re, ‘Tib-r Esowo Nsoo?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:15</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />A nehme taame re, me n wob Nsoo go atahng, Nsoo tob wob-m go atahnga? Alum nya n kpꞌbungu tong-n, nyanyame sang. Nsoo no wob-m go atahng, ye wo n kpi eltum ene lim. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Taamen tv-m re me n wob Nsoo go atahng, Nsoo tob wob-m go atahng. Tohko jol ano, lub taamen tib go eltum ename ni n kpꞌlimi.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />“Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Nne no lꞌtaame tv-m, á bahke tob lim eltum ni n kpꞌlimi. Jol á bahke limi na eltum ni gbale gbal sehng eltum ni n kpꞌlimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 2:41; Rom 15:19</char></note> Tibre n kpꞌtahme goji Nsoo. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌbahb go egama mbing, m bahke limi ka-n, eji Mmon lꞌtib ellub ni Nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌbahb go egama mbing, m bahke limi ka-n.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyame no re á bahke tumu Etingi Etohko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“N lꞌkor-n, ḿ bahke bumu atahm enyame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:3</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />M bahke gboongo Nsoo, á fere tum nkakebo noko tv-n, eji á lꞌba jol a nahne go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:26; 16:7,13</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Nne noo, Etingi Etohko ji, ji njini lꞌkꞌma bel. Tibre njini we nehme nyehn, jol bo we nehme kahn. Wahn ba kp-e kahne. Tibre á bahke jolo a nahne, fere woom-n go egahne atahng.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Wahn n nehm yake abo, ń jol ana abon akubin. M bahke kpe feere ba go egahne. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Mmongare ntiil, njini nyia me nehm kpe nyehn. Wahn bahk-m jo nyꞌnyehn. Tib eji me n li go elkpin, owo wahnge ḿ bahke tob jol go elkpin. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Efung bio bi ḿ bahke kahne re, me n wob Nsoo go atahng, wahn wob-m go atahng, me n tob wob-n go atahng.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Nne no lꞌwuk atahm enyame, fere bum, ye wo li nne no n kp-e koro. Nne no, me n lꞌkor-e, á bahke tob kor Nsoo. Me fvfo, á bahk-m tob kor, n fere lennge elname ka-e.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judas jehko ji mmon a Jems kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntul, bahke jolo renan re wo lennge elna ka-r, kꞌtob lennge elna ka njini?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nne no, me n lꞌkor-e, á bahke bumu alum enyame. Á bahke koro Nsoo. Me, a Nsoo, e bahke bake, ba lene tob-e go ege atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 3:17</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Nne no, me n tohk-e kor, á nehm jo bum alum enyame. Alum nya ḿ ma wuk, alum nyanyame sang, nya Nsoo no tum-m no nya.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nsol nyia a, n kpꞌbungu a nahne, eji n kpeke li a nahne. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Nkakebo no Nsoo bahke tumu go egama mbing, no li Etingi Etohko, á bahk-n tibi nsol kpee, fere buum-n nsol kpee nyi m ma-n tohko tong. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />N kpꞌtahme elkoono sa-n. Elkoono nꞌname ni m bahk-n kake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 4:7</char></note> Wahn n nehme ka ana njini nyia kpo ka. Kana ga jo tiiri, fere jo fahl mbol mbol!<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />“Ń wꞌwuk, eji n tong-n no re, ‘M bahke tahme, kehm kpe feere ba go egahne.’ Li re n kp-n koro, kehn ń jol bele eyebatahng. Tibre n kpꞌtahme goji Nsoo. Nsoo wo ga gbal sehnge me. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Anv, m ma-n tohko tong, ngare nyio kehm rehnge, eji lꞌkehme ellimi, ń lꞌtaame. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />N nehm kpe ga bung a nahne gbalee. Tibre ntubesi no njini nyia kpꞌbake. Jol we n wobem go elwo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />N kpo lim ana Nsoo tong-m no, eji njini nyia lꞌkahn re, Nsoo kpo kor-m sehng. Tahmen, wahr tahm edi jia!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li etingitingi evain (evain, eti ji)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Me wo li etingitingi evain. Nsoo wo li nne no kpo lim eltum go etahngga, jo kuuru nti enye. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Mbꞌbo eti anyehng anyehng nyi tohko kab akab, á gbahk tub go. Mbꞌbo eti anyehng anyehng nyi lꞌkab akab, á kpo tele na sere, eji lꞌkpe kab akab gbalee budu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Wahn ebsi bꞌbar tib go alum nya m ma bung tong-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:10</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Jolen a name, m bahke tob jol a nahne. Ana mbo eti lꞌkꞌma kab akab antahng, tohko tiki jol re á laake go ekꞌkv eti, ano wo tob li ka-n fvfo re, ń nehm ma kab akab, tohko tiki jol re ń laake me.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Me wo li ekꞌkv eti, wahn ba li abꞌbo eti. Nne no lꞌya laak-m, ye wo m bahke tob laak-e, á bahke kabe akab gbalee. Tib tohko tiki jol re, ń ya laake me, ń nehm ma lim ejumjum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:5</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Nne no tohko ya laake me, bo bahk-e kimi tub go ana mbꞌbo eti. Á bahke wuudu sa o kpo. Abꞌbo nyao, bo bahke kpuku na luk edi ajehng, jahm agun. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ń lꞌya laak-m, alum enyame tob jol a nahne, bahben ajehng ajehng ji ń kpꞌsebe, ḿ bahke bele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:22</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ana wo Nsoo bahke jo bel ellub, ń lꞌjo kab akab.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:22</char></note> Tibre nyao nya bahke tibi re, wahn abatꞌtoono ebame ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ana n kpꞌkoro Nsoo, ano wo wahn kp-m tob kor. Jolen go egame elkoro! <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ń lꞌbum atahm enyame, ḿ bahke jolo go egame elkoro, jang jang ana m ma bum atahm nya Nsoo, fere jol go ege elkoro. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />M ma-n tong nsol nyia ana, goji eyebatahng ejame lꞌjol a nahne, fere rur go egahna ntim.<verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />“A wo li ntahm enyame, nyi li re, wahn bel elkoro atemtem, ana ń kp-m koro. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Elkoro anehng anehng limm, ni nne bahke ma bel, ni biingi a nia ni li re, nne yake elkpin ene ka go esi atem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:16</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Wahn ate ebame ba, ń lꞌlim ji n tong-n no.<verse eid="JHN 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />“Wahn n nehme kpe lung re alokeltum nkpel anyehng anyehng. Tibre nlokeltum kpehme kahn ji nde kpꞌlimi. M ma-n lung re ate ebame. Tibre nsol kpee nyi n wuku goji Nsoo, me n lennge kpee ka-n. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Wahn sang yehke me, me wo yehk-n na re wahn song kab akab, akab enyahne jol kꞌbol. Owo bahke wahnge ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌbahb Nsoo go egama mbing, á bahk-n kake. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ji n kp-n tongo li re, wahn bel elkoro atemtem.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana njini kpo ko aneb Esowo ekv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Njini nyia lꞌko-n ekv, nobo re wahn kahn re, bo gbo mbang ko me ekv, kehm tob ko-n ekv. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Li re ń wob go njini nyia, kehn ḿ bahke jo kor njini nyia, are wahn ane ebe ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:5</char></note> Eji ń ki wob go njini nyia, m ma-n jak yehke go njini nyia a, owo wahnge njini nyia kp-n koko ekv.<verse eid="JHN 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />“Jo buumen ellum ni m bungu tong-n re, ‘Nlokeltum kpehme gbal sehnge nde.’ Ana bo jo gbak-m, ano wo fvfo bo bahke tob jo gbak-n. Ana bo jo bum alum enyame, ano wo fvfo bo bahke tob jo bum alum enyahne. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Bo bahk-n limi nsol nyia kpee tib go egame esi. Tibre bo nehme kahn nne no tum-m no.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />“Ki li re m ba, ba bung a bo, kehn bo jolem lehke ebi go bo abiafem. Wo anv, aneb abiafem bao, ejum ellaange kunu ajehng ajehng bo kpeem kpi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Nne no lꞌko-m ekv, á tob ko Nsoo ekv.<verse eid="JHN 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />“Li re n limem akpokosi nyao go bo ellong, nya nne awohng awohng kala lꞌlim, kehn bo jolem lehke ebi go bo abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:11</char></note> Anv, bobnyehn nsol kpee nyi n limi no, jol bo kp-m koko ekv tv o, fere tob ko Nsoo ekv. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Jia li, eji ellum ni bo nyono go bo atahm lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi, ni li re, ‘Bo ko-m ekv, eji n ki lim ejumjum.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Nkakebo no li a Nsoo lꞌba, no m bahk-e tumu tv-n, ye ji li Etingi Etohko ji lohng goji Nsoo, á bahke jo yiimi ntianse ka-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:26; Luk 24:49</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Wahn fvfo, wahn tob li atianse enyame, tibre ń jolo a name, go mbomannahb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 1:8; 5:32</char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />N tong-n alum nyaa, eji ń lꞌkꞌgbo. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Tibre bo bahke jo kam-n yehke go ero. Etingitingi, ngare kpꞌbake nyi nne awohng awohng no lꞌwul-n, á bahke tiri re, á kpi Esowo loko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:9; Gal 1:13-14</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bo bahke jo lim ana, tibre bo m-e nehme kahn, jol Nsoo bo we nehme kahn. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />M ma-n tong nsol nyia re, eji ngare nyio lꞌbiingi nyi bo bahke limi ano, ń lꞌbuumu nsol nyi n tong-n no bada bo. Wahn n tongem nsol nyia go mbomannahb, tibre n jolo a nahne.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltum ni Etingi Etohko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jon 14:16</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 14:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:26">15:26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Anv, n kpꞌtahme goji nne no tum-m no. Nne ewahne awohng awohng limm, no kp-m bahbe re, ‘Gan wo a kpꞌtahme?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Alum nya m ma-n tong nya wahnge ndon ma-n jol go atahng gbalee. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />N kp-n tongo etingitingi re, bahke nobo a nahne sehng, n lꞌtahm. N tohko tahm, Nkakebo nehm ba. N lꞌtahm, m bahk-e tumu tv-n.<verse eid="JHN 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />“Á lꞌba, á bahke ba lennge ane ba li njini nyia bade ana abiafem li no, fere lennge bo bade ana eno alehke li no, go elam ji Esowo ji kpꞌbake. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Abiafem nyao nya li nya bo kil taame tv-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:29</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Eno alehke jio, jꞌjame ji. Tibre n kpꞌtahme goji Nsoo, bo m-e nehm kpe tiki nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:31; Rom 4:25</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Elam jio ji li elam ji bo ma lam ntubesi no njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:31</char></note><verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“N kpe kpi nsol tvv nyi n jol kpe bung a nahne. Anv, ngare nyia, kpꞌriidi re wahn kehm kahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:26</char></note><verse eid="JHN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />“Etingi Etohko jio lꞌba, á bahke jo tib-n mbang anyehng anyehng nyi etingitingi. Tibre á nehm jo bung alum nyanye go ege a nsahm. Ajehng ajehng ji á wuku no, jꞌnehm ji á bahke bungu. Á bahk-n lennge nsol nyi kpꞌbake go esꞌsong. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Á bahke me ellub ka. Á bahke koko nsol nyꞌnyame, ba lennge ka-n.<verse eid="JHN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />“Ejum ajehng ajehng ji Nsoo kpi no, tob li jꞌjame. Ana wo wahnge n tong-n re, á bahke koko jꞌjame, ba lennge ka-n.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndon, a eyebatahng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Mmongare ntiil ḿ m-e nehm kpe nyehn. Lꞌkpe kang mmongare noko, ḿ bahk-m kpe nyehn.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Abatꞌtoono ebe bandiki kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, alum nyaa lohngo renan, nya á kp-r tongo a re, ‘Mmongare ntiil ḿ m-e nehm kpe nyehn, lꞌkpe kang mmongare noko, ḿ bahk-m kpe nyehn,’ a ellum nehko ni kpe li re, ‘Tibre n kpꞌtahme goji Nsoo?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bo kehm bahbe re, “Anv, ‘mmongare ntiil’ lohngo renan? E nehme kahn ji á kpꞌsebe re á bung tong-r.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Jisos kꞌkahn re, bo kpꞌsebe re bo bahb-e. Owo á kehm tongo bo re, “M bungu re, ‘Mmongare ntiil ḿ m-e nehm kpe nyehn. Lꞌkang mmongare noko, ḿ bahk-m kpe nyehn.’ Ellum nia ni, ń kpꞌbahbe atemtem ana lohngo noa? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Ḿ bahke lingi, fere jo ka agohrobi, gana njini bahke jo bel na eyebatahng. Ḿ bahke jo ji ndon ndon, ndon enyahne bahke fere siingi eyebatahng ka-n. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Eji nnenkal yahke jel, á kpo nyehn erem, tibre ngare erem enye ebrehng, ngare nyi á ma jel mmon, á nehm kpe tiki buumu erem bi á nyehne no, tib go eyebatahng ji á ma jel mmon kak go njini nyia. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi, ń li go ndon anv, ḿ bahk-m kpe nyehn. Ngare nyio ntim enyahne bahke gbale go eyebatahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:19-20; Fil 4:4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Efung bio me ń nehm kpe jo bahb ejumjum. Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-n re, Ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌbahb Nsoo, á bahk-n kake tib go egama mbing. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Jol tete sik anv, ń ka tiki bahb ejumjum go egama mbing. Bahben, ḿ bahke bele, goji eyebatahng ejahne lꞌkpe gbal go egahne atahng.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos ga njini nyia a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Alum nya m bungu tong-n, m bungu go ngaane. Ngare kpꞌbake nyi n lꞌkꞌkpe bung a nahne go ngaane. M bahke jo bung gbuul tong-n bada Nsoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 4:10-11</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Afung nyao lꞌbiingi, ḿ bahke jo bahb Nsoo go egama mbing. Wahn n nehme tong re, m bahke jo bahb Nsoo ka-n. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Tibre yefono Nsoo, wahn kp-e koro, tib eji me n kp-n koro, ḿ ma fere taame re, n lohng goji Nsoo ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />N lohng goji Nsoo ba go njini nyia. Anv, n kpꞌtahme njini nyia, feere goji Nsoo.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e tongo re, “Anv, a kpꞌbungu gbuul tong-r, go ngaane sang. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Anv, wahr ebkahn re, a kpꞌkahne ejum ajehng ajehng. Kpeem fuumu re, nne awohng awohng bahb-a mbahbe. Owo wahng ka e ma taame re, a lohko lohng goji Esowo ba.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Anv wo, ḿ ma kehm rahng taama? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ngare kpꞌbake nyi nne awohng awohng ewahne bahk-m yaame sa, tahm go ege ejahbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 14:27,50</char></note> Ngare nyꞌnehm nyi a. Jol fvfo, n nehm tiki jol antahng. Nsoo noa a name. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />M bungu alum nyaa tong-n, eji ń lꞌbel elkoono tib go egame esi. Go njini nyia ḿ bahke jo bel afemfem. Kana jo tiiri, me n ga njini nyia.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:4</char></note><verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jo kak ero ka abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Eji Jisos ma bung alum nyao kpee mal, á kehm kpiidi amahr enye go ero, kehm kehme ero kak re, “Nsoo, ngare ebbiingi. Ka mmon ewa ellub, eji mmon ewa lꞌtob ka-a ellub. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Tibre wobyake ane kpee kak go ege elwo, eji á lꞌka ane ba a yehke no ka-e elkpin ni li go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:27</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />“Elkpin ni li go njinanjini ni li elkahne ni ane ma-a kahn, fere kahn re, wo ntahngtahng wo li etingitingi Esowo, tob kahn Jisos Kraist ji a tum-e no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:20</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Eji n jolo go njini, n jo ka-a ellub. Me n lim eltum ni a ka-m no mal. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nsoo, ka-m ellub anv go ega esamahr, ellub ni m bele go ega ngare nyi njini kala jol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:6</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Me n lennge mbing enya tong ane ba a yehke no go njini nyia ka-m. Bo jolo ane eba, ba a yehke no ka-m. Boblohko bum alum enya. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Anv, bo kpꞌkahne re, ajehng ajehng ji a ka-m no lohng go ega. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Tibre me m bung alum enya tong bo, nya a tong-m no. Bobtaame tv alum nyao, fere kahn go etingitingi re, me n lohng go ega ba. Boblohko taame re, wo wo tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />N kpꞌkake ero ka bo. N nehme kak ero ka njini nyia a. N kpꞌkake ero ka bao ba a ka-m no. Tibre bo ane eba ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji n kpi no, jꞌja ji. Ajehng ajehng ji a kpi no, jꞌjame ji. Bo ba kpꞌtibi ellub ename. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Anv, n kpeem li go njini, bo ba kpeke li go njini. N kpꞌbake go ega. Mbarebara Nsoo, jo fili bao ba a ka-m no go nsahm nyi li go ega mbing, eji bo lꞌjol ajehng ana wahr li ajehng. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Eji n jolo a bao ba a ka-m no, n jo fili bo go ega mbing, fere jo baabe bo. Nne awohng awohng limm, no ma tan, sehngem nne no tiki jol re á tan, ye wo ma tan, eji nwer Esowo lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Anv, n kpꞌbake go ega. Alum nya n kpꞌbungu ga njini nyia li, eji eyebatahng ejame lꞌgbal go bo atahng. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Me m bung alum enya tong bo. Njini ebko bo ekv, tibre bo wobem go njini nyia, jang jang ana me n ki tob wob go njini nyia. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />N nehme kak ero re, wo yehke bo go njini nyia. N kpꞌkake ero re, wo baabe bo nob nob, eji abꞌbi lꞌkꞌyel go bo atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 3:13</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bo wobem go njini, ana mefono antahng ki tob wob go njini.<verse eid="JHN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />“Ko etingitingi, wo yehke bo, bo jol ebo ebo. Alum enya, etingitingi ji. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ana a tum-m no tv go njini nyia, ano wo fvfo m ma tob tum bo tv go njini. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Tib go bo esi wo wahnge, n kpꞌrodo elname ka, eji bofono antahng lꞌjol ebo ebo, fere sa go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“N kpꞌkake ero ka bo, fere tob kak ero ka ane bako fvfo, bao ba bahke tob taame tv-m tib go bo alum. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nsoo, n kpꞌkake ero re bo jol ajehng, bo ane kpee, ana a wob-m go atahng, me n tob wob-a go atahng, eji bo kpee lꞌtob woom-r go atahng, eji lꞌtoono o, njini nyia tob taame re, wo wo tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Ellub ni a ma-m ka, me n faake a ni ka bo, eji bo lꞌjol ajehng ana wahr li ajehng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 4:32</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />m bahke woomo go bo atahng ana wo wob-m go atahng, eji bo lꞌlohko jol na ajehng ana jꞌjehng. Ano wo bahke wahnge njini kahn re, wo li nne no tum-m no, fere kahn re, bo kp-a koro ana n kp-a koro.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Nsoo, n kpꞌsebe re, ane ba a ka-m no jol a name edi ji n li no, eji bo lꞌnyehn ellub ni a ma-m ka, tib go ega elkoro ni n kor-a no ngare nyi njini kala jol. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Nnobonoba nsoo, njini nyia ana wa ka kahn. Wo, me n kp-a kahne. Ane baa ana kpꞌkahne re, wo wo tum-m no. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Me n lennge mbing enya ka bo. M bahke soro asi, jo lim ano ano, eji elkoro ni n kp-a koro lꞌwoomo go bo atahng, me n fere tob woomo go bo atahng.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo bobo Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Eji Jisos ma kak ero mal, á kehm tahme, a abatꞌtoono ebe, song siiri ebgba bi bo jo lung re Kidron. Etahngga jolo ona edi jio. Jisos kehm yele ona, a abatꞌtoono ebe.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Judas ji gungu Jisos jo tob kahn edi jio. Tibre Jisos, bo jo kono eljeke ona song kono, a abatꞌtoono ebe. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Judas kehm song kpiri atubesi abalimajom, a Bab Farisi. Bo kehm-e kake nsoja, a egom ane bandiki ba kpo baabe etahk Esowo. Bo fili atꞌrekahng, fili nrꞌrare nyi bo bunu no, jo ko nyaale agun, fere fili nsol ebta, tahm a nyi edi jio o.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Jisos kꞌkahn nsol kpee nyi bahk-e limi. Á kehm jeere song kpiri bo, kehm bahbe bo re, “Nne awo ń kp-e sebe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Jisos ji Nasaret wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Me wo a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judas ji gung-e no, tob yiimi o go bo ellong. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Eji Jisos tongo bo re, “Me wo a,” bo kehm feere njahm njahm, song gbo go ndi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:17-18</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Á kehm kpe bahb bo re, “Nne awo ń kp-e sebe?” Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Jisos ji Nasaret wo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jisos kehm kpe faange bo re, “N tong-n re, ‘Me wo ana.’ Joare me wo ń kp-m sebe, yaken ane baa, bo song.”<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Á bungu ellum nia, eji lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi, ana á tohko bung re, “Ane ba a ka-m no, nne awohng awohng limm, no ma tan.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Saimon Pita bele ekahngkahng ona, á kehm wobo go mbak, kpale nju nyi ntubesi abalimajom etung eboblum. Nju nyio, bo jo lung-e re Malkus.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Jisos kehm tongo Pita re, “Feere ekahngkahng eba, wo kak go mbak. Anv, me n kꞌwo go nkob erem nyi Nsoo ka-m noa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 10:45</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr Annas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ntubesi a nsoja, a nsoja enye nyio, a egom ane ba jo baabe etahk Esowo kehm ba bob Jisos, fere gba-e alehke. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bo tohko gbo mbang ko-e tahm a ne goji Annas ji jolo nde nkal a Kayafas, Kayafas ji jolo ntubesi abalimajom go elya nio. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafas wo jolo nne no tubu Jus elle re, “Nobo re nne awohng kpo go esi ane kpee.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:49-51</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pita gbaame re, Jisos we á nyimm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mak 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Saimon Pita, a ntꞌtoono Jisos noko, bo kehm kehme Jisos toono. Ntꞌtoono Jisos noko kehm song yange go nlaaga nyi ntubesi abalimajom, tibre ntubesi abalimajom noo jo kahn-e kpee. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Pita ji gana kohlo mbuga. Ntꞌtoono Jisos noko no ntubesi abalimajom jo kahn-e, kehm lohngo song tong nnenkal no jo baabe mbuga re á nongo Pita yange.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Nnenkal noo no jo baabe mbuga kehm bahbe Pita re, “Anv, wo ntꞌtoono a nne noo sanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Pita kehm faange re, “Ee, me ntꞌtoono ewe sang.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ngare nyio ona alohk jo fꞌfili. Owo alokeltum bao, a abꞌbaabe edi kehm kono agun go akal nsehng. Bo kehm yiimi sennge agun nyao kak, jo wooro. Pita yiimi go bo ellong o, tob jo wooro.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ntubesi abalimajom jo bahb Jisos abahbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ntubesi abalimajom jo bahbe Jisos bade abatꞌtoono ebe, fere bahb-e bade eltibi ene.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “N jo bungu gbul gbul gbuul tong nne awohng awohng. Ngare anyehng anyehng n jo tibi eltibi ename go ntahk ero, fere jo tib go etahk Esowo, edi ji Jus kpee jo ba kono. Ejumjum limm, ji n jo bung mbehr mbehr. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Jen ji wahnge a kp-m abahbe bahb? Bahb ane ba wuku nsol nyi m bungu no. Bo kpꞌkahne nsol nyi m bungu no.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Eji Jisos bung ano, owo mbꞌbaabe awohng no yiimi kohl-e kehm-e rumu elkpal, kehm-e tongo re, “Jen ji wahnge a kehm faange ntubesi abalimajom elkohn nfaange ana nyia?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Joare me n soodo, eji m bungu a, lennge tong nne awohng awohng ji n soodo no. Joare ellum ni m bungu no, m bungu go etingitingi, jen ji wahnge a kehm-m rumu elkpal?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:39</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Owo Annas kehm tumu Jisos, a alehke alehke nya bo gba-e no tv goji Kayafas ji jolo ntubesi abalimajom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pita kpe gbaame re, Jisos we á nyimm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mak 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Eji Saimon Pita kpeke yim, kpi agun wooro, bo kehm-e kpe bahb re, “Wo ntꞌtoono a nne noo sanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Pita kehm kpe gbaame re, “Ee, me ntꞌtoono ewe sang.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Nlokeltum a Ntubesi abalimajom awohng no jolo mmonannyehn nne no Pita kpal-e etung, kehm bahbe Pita re, “Wo sang n nyehn-a no go etahngga, a nne nooa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Pita kehm kpe gbaame. Nkok kehm soro kuk tvtv.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr Pailet, nne a Rom no jo fili Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Efungfu atv atv bo kehm koko Jisos go etahk Kayafas, tahm a ne go etahk ntubesi ejahbe. Jus joom yel go ekpꞌkpa ntubesi, tibre bofono antahng jo sebe re bo bum elbo saang, eji bo lꞌmal li elkak Pasova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:3; 23:25-28</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Owo Pailet kehm lohngo go elatahk, ba kpiri bo, kehm ba bahb bo re, “Ejum aji wahnge wahng ń kpi nne noa ebi ka?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Li re nne noa ebi nne sang, kehn we e jolem koko ba a ne.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pailet kehm tongo bo re, “Koon ye, wahn lam-e ana atahm enyahne bungu no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Jus kehm-e faange re, “Bo nehm taame re, wahr wul nne.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Jia limi, eji ebung ji Jisos bungu no lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi, ana á bungu no bade elkohn elkv ni á bahke kpoko.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pailet kehm feere song yel go ege ekpꞌkpa, kehm lungu Jisos, kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, wo wo li ntul no Jusa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Anv, mbahbe nyia a tiri antahnga, afi ane bandiki ba tong-a bada name?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pailet kehm bungu re, “Anv, me nne a Jus woa? Ane eba, a atubesi abalimajom, bo ba yak-a no ka-m. Anv, a limi jen?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Me ntul sang go njini nyia. Li re n li ntul go njini nyia, kehn alokeltum ebame jol noko ka-m, eji bo lꞌki-m yake kak Jus go ebo. Tibre me ntul sang go njini nyia.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pailet kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, lohngo re wo ntul woa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Ee, wobbung etingitingi re, me ntul wo. M ba go njini nyia re, me m ba bung bade etingitingi. Tibre esi jia ji wahnge bo jel-m no. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌjol ka etingitingi jio, á kpo wuk alum enyame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pailet kehm-e bahbe re, “Ejum aji li re etingitingi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Elam ji bo lame re, bo wul Jisos</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mak 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Eji Pailet ma bung ano mal, á kehm kpe lohng go elatahk, ba kpiri Jus, kehm ba tong bo re, “Ebi ajehng ajehng n nyehnem ji nne noo ma lim. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ń kpi eljini ni n kpo kono nne a ngbekobo ewahne awohng yehke yake ngare elkak Pasova. Ń kpꞌsebe re me n yehke ntul ewahne noo yaka?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bo kehm-e faange wahre wahre wahre re, “Barabas wo e kpꞌsebe re wo yehk-e yake. Nne noo sang!” Barabas jolo nne no jo jen, jo taare ane nsol go nsahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 3:13-15</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Pailet kehm kake nsahm re, bo ko Jisos song dv-e. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nsoja nyio kehm koko akpiri, tahng ekpasi, konng-e go esi. Bo kehm rodo ekpawobo kak-e, mbilibili ekpawobo ji atul kpo kono elkake. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Bo kehm jo ba lim ayok re, “E ma-a kak nnyo, ntul no Jus,” fere jo ruum-e nkpal.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pailet kehm kpe lohng go elatahk, kpe song tong Jus re, “M bahke kpe lohng a ne ba, eji ń lꞌkahn re, ejumjum n nyehnem ji á limi no.”<verse eid="JHN 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Owo Jisos kehm lohngo ba go elatahk, a ekpasi akpiri jio go esi, a mbilibili ekpawobo ji bo kak-e no. Pailet kehm tongo bo re, “Nyehnen nne noa ga.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Eji atubesi abalimajom, a abꞌbaabe nyehn-e no, bo kehm kehme elrabe re, “Kum-e lake go ekros! Kum-e lake go ekros!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pailet kehm tongo bo re, “Koon ye antahng, wahn song kum-e, tibre ejumjum n nyehnem ji á limi no.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Jus kehm-e faange re, “E kpi ntahm, tib go ntahm nyio ona fuumu re á kpo. Tibre yebrod elne bum re, ye Mmon Esowo wo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:33</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Eji Pailet wuku alum nya bo bungu no, á kpe fꞌfahl na budu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Á kehm kpe maade yel go ege ekpꞌkpa, song bahb Jisos re, “Anv, a lohng gan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Jisos we faangem efaangefaange.<verse eid="JHN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Owo Pailet kehm-e bahbe re, “A nehm bung a nama? Anv, a nehme kahn re, n kpi nsahm nyi m bahk-a ma yake, a fora, fere bel nsahm nyi m bahk-a ma kum go ekrosa?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Ki li re Esowo bi ka-a nsahm, kehn a jolem ma bel nsahm nyi a bahk-m wulu. Nne no ko-m no, ba kak-a go abo, ye wo ma ga lim abiafem.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pailet wuku kan alum nyao o, á kehm kehme elsebe mbang ana nyi á bahk-e yehke yake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:12">Jus kehm kpe kehme elrabe re, “A lꞌyehke nne noo yake, a nehm kpe jol ntem a ntul no Rom. Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌtong re, ye ntul wo, á li nnekv no ntul a Rom.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pailet wuku kan alum nyaa a me, á kehm soro yehke Jisos lohng a ne go elatahk, kehm fere song ji go ege eti elam, edi ji bo jo lung re Pevment ji bo jo lung go alum Hibru re Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Efung bio jolo efung bi bo jo toobo ebjing bi Pasova.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Ngare efin Pailet kehm tongo Jus re, “Nyehnen, ntul ewahne gana!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Bo kehm rabe re, “Tahmen a ne! Tahmen a ne! Song kumen ye go ekros!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pailet kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, ń kpꞌsebe re me n kum ntul ewahne go ekrosa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Atubesi abalimajom kehm faange re, “Ntul awohng awohng e kpimm, sehngem ntul a Rom wo wo e kpi no.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pailet kehm yake Jisos ka bo re bo song kum-e go ekros. Bo kehm-e koko tahm a ne.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo kumu Jisos go ekros</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Jisos kehm solo ekros eje, song rehng go edi ji bo jo lung re edi nkpakesi, ji bo jo lung go alum Hibru re Golgota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Owo bo kum-e lake go ekros. Ane abal ba bo tob kum bo o, nne noko go ejang eboblum, noko go ejang ebobkal, Jisos woomo go elka elka.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pailet nyono mmonwer lake go ekros, no bungu re, “Jisos ji Nasaret, ntul no Jus wo ana.”<verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Anebe Jus gbalee ba jo lung mmonwer noo. Tibre edi ji bo kumu Jisos jolo kohlo go nla ejahbe. Mmonwer noo bo nyono go Hibru, fere nyon go Latin, fere nyon go Grik.<verse eid="JHN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Atubesi abalimajom kehm tongo Pailet re, “A jolem nyono re Ntul no Jus, a jol nyono re, Nne noa bungu re, ye ntul no Jus wo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pailet kehm faange re, “Ji m ma nyon, tiki li ana n nyono no.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ngare nyi nsoja nyio ma kum Jisos go ekros, bo kehm rodo nsol ebjing enye baange, bo ane ani. Bo tꞌtob rod nsubu enye nyi bo tubu no, nyi ki bel nkon anyehng anyehng.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Nong, wahr kꞌkiimi nsubu nyia baange, wahr tub na elfaange, nyehn nne no bahke bele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Jia limi, eji nwer Esowo lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi ana bungu no re, “Bobbaange nsol ebjing enyame, fere tub elfaange, gohro ko nsubu enyame.”<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Owo nsoja nyio kehm limi ano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:25">Nnyehn Jisos yiimi ona kohlo go ekros, a mmonannyehn, a Meri nkal a Klopas, go Meri ji lohng go Magdala.<verse eid="JHN 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Eji Jisos nyehne nnyehn, a ntꞌtoono ewe no jo sahb kor-e kor yim kohlo o, á kehm tongo nnyehn re, “Nnenkal, nyehn mmon ewa o!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:23</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Á kehm tongo ntꞌtoono ewe noo re, “Nne no wa wo a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:27">Bomo ngare nyio asongo ntꞌtoono noo kehm-e koko tahm a ne go ege etahk, á song lene tob-e.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Eji ma jol ano, Jisos kꞌkahn re, nsol kpee ebmal. Owo á kehm bungu re, “Alahb ma-m kor,” goji alum Esowo lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi.<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Etu jekke ona, ji bo kake alahb ma bo kpo lung re evinegar. Bo kehm soro tub ndꞌdahng kak go alahb mao, tung go ebti, song koor-e go nnyo.<verse eid="JHN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Jisos wo kan alahb mao, á kehm bungu re, “Ebmal,” kehm soro yake elkpin ene ka go, bahk emel kpo.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jahme Jisos elkong go ngbaange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Efung bio jolo efung ebjing atoobo bi Esabat. Jus kehm song bahb Pailet, joare á bahke taame re, bo song banne ane ba kpaake go akros akpade, fere fono bo. Bo joom seb re, akv ebo kpe kpaake go akros egburu efung Esabat bi jolo etoono efung behko. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Nsoja kehm bake, ba banne nne noko no bo kum-e kohlo Jisos akpade, fere kpe banne nne noko akpade fvfo.<verse eid="JHN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Eji bo ba rehng goji Jisos, bo sebe kahn re, yeblohko kpo. Bo we bannem akpade. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nne a nsoja awohng kehm-e jahme elkong go ngbaange. Owo alung kehm lohngo, semme alahb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:6-8</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nne noo no nyehne ji ma lim o, ye wo yiimi ntianse,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 21:24</char></note> goji wahn fvfo lꞌtob taame. Ntianse enye lohko li go etingitingi. Á kpꞌkahne re, alum enye lohko li go etingitingi.<verse eid="JHN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Nsol nyia kpee limi, goji nwer Esowo lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi, nyi bungu re, “Ekahb eje ajehng ajehng limm, ji bo bahke bahne.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Edi nwer Esowo jehko kpe bung re, “Ane bahke seenge nne noo no bo jahm-e elkong.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 1:7</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo ko Jisos song kak go elahm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Josef ji lohng go Arimatia kehm song bahb Pailet, joare á bahke taame, á fono ekv ji Jisos tahm a ji. Josef jo toono Jisos mbehr mbehr, tib á jo fahle Jus. Pailet kehm taame, owo Josef kehm bake, ba fono ekv ji Jisos tahm a ji. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nekodimos ji tohko je goji Jisos atv amehng kehm koko nsol nyi kpo v esꞌsvv ji nno a nno, ba a nyi, nyi jo lub ana ekpa akang ji nnen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:2</char></note> Nsol nyio bo ko anyane nya bo kpo lung re mmir, a aloe semme, kehm limi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bo ane abal abal kehm rodo ekv ji Jisos ba a ji, ba wohngo nsol nyio, kpennge abarebare abomo, ana eljini elkv alimi ni Jus jolo no. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Etahngga jolo edi ji bo kumu Jisos go ekros. Elahm jolo go etahngga jio, bi bo kala kꞌkak nnene. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Eji jolo efung bi bahke sene efung Esabat, tibre elahm bio jolo kpidi kpidi, owo bo kehm koko ekv ji Jisos song kak elahm bio.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ana elahm sa ekpakekpake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ngbokambang efung go erahde, Meri ji lohng go Magdala kehm fungu go elahm efungfu atv atv, kehm song nyehn eltal ni bo bannge bulu go nnyo elahm ma bannge noongo go nkpe. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Á kehm beke tahm goji Saimon Pita, a ntꞌtoono Jisos noko go fvfo, no jo sahb kꞌkor Jisos,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:23</char></note> kehm song tong bo re, “Bobyehke Ntul ewahre go elahm fi a ne. E nehme kahn edi ji bo m-e song bum.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Pita, a ntꞌtoono noko, bo kehm mehle tahm gona elahm. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bo ane abal abal jo be abahl. Ntꞌtoono noko be sehnge Pita, gbo mbang song rehng go elahm. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Á kehm song kehme, jo fahng go elahm, kehm nyehne abarebare abomo nyao nong no go atahng. Á yelem go atahng. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Saimon Pita ji jo tob toon-e, kehm bake, ba sehng na sehng, yel go elahm, kehm nyehne abarebare abomo nyao nong no, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />fere nyehn mbomo mi bo kpennge Jisos go esi. Noongem edi ajehng a abarebare abomo nyako. Mbomo mio mi bo kpennge Jisos go esi noongo elfehd.<verse eid="JHN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Owo ntꞌtoono noko no gbo mbang rehng go elahm, kehm tob yel song nyehn, fere taame. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Tibre wuku wuku bo tikem kahn edi nwer Esowo ji bungu re, á bahke nyahme go elkv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:4; Elt 2:22-36; 13:35-37</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Abatꞌtoono Jisos bao kehm feere kehnge.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos song kpiri Meri ji lohng go Magdala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mak 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Meri yiimi eje kohlo elahm, jo ling. Eji á jo ling, á kehm kehme, jo fahng go elahm. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Á kehm nyehne enjel na ebal nyi kake abarebare nsol jehk no go edi jio ji bo kake ekv ji Jisos, noko ji edi ji esi Jisos noongo no, noko ji edi ji akpade nya Jisos noongo no.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Enjel nyio kehm-e bahbe re, “Nnenkal, jen ji wahnge a kpꞌlingi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Á kehm faange bo re, “Tibre bobyehke Ntul ewame fi a ne. N nehme kahn edi ji bo bum-e no.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Á bungu kan ana mal, á kehm soro keebe, nyehn Jisos yim no. Á kahnem re, Jisos wo.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Nnenkal, jen ji wahnge a kpꞌlingi? Nne awo a kp-e sebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Meri jo tiri re, nne no kpo lim eltum etahngga jio wo. Owo á kehm-e tongo re, “Nsoo, joare wo wo rod-e, tib-m edi ji a bum-e no, eji n lꞌsong rod-e tahm a ne.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jisos kehm-e lungu re, “Meri!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Meri kehm keebe, kehm bungu go ellum Hibru re, “Rabbuni,” ji lohngo re ntꞌtibi.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Ka ma lak abo, eji n kala tahm go ero goji Nsoo. Song goji abonanee,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:11-12</char></note> wo song tong bo re, n kpꞌtahme go ero goji Nsoo, no tob li Nso ejahne. N fi goji Esowo ebame, bi tob li Esowo ebahne.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Meri ji lohng go Magdala kehm tahme song kpiri abatꞌtoono Jisos, kehm tongo bo re, “Me n nyehn Ntul,” fere tong bo ana Jisos bungu no tong-e.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos song kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Efung bꞌnehm ona bi jolo ngbokambang efung go erahde, elgung nio ona, abatꞌtoono Jisos woomo ekpꞌkpa ajehng, gbaange abutahk kpee tv elbo, tibre bo jo fahle Jus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:19">Jisos kehm bake, ba yiimi go bo ellong, kehm kake bo nnyo re, “Belen elkoono!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Á bungu kan ano mal me, á kehm tibi bo abo enye, a ngbaange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:1</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:20">Abatꞌtoono ebe bele eyebatahng sehng, eji bo nyehne Ntul abo.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Jisos kehm kpe kak bo nnyo re, “Belen elkoono! Ana Nsoo tum-m no, ano wo fvfo n kp-n tob tum.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:8</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Á bungu kan ano mal me, á kehm soro fahle elfeb wohngo bo, kehm bungu tong bo re, “Taaren Etingi Etohko! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ń lꞌtahm ka nne go ege abiafem, yeblohko bel eltahmeka. Ń tohko tahm ka nne go ege abiafem, á bahke sake ano go ege abiafem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:19; 18:18</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos abola Tomos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomos ji woomo go ellong abatꞌtoono Jisos, ewubu ane abal, ji bo jo lung-e re Ayafele, á jolem a bo ona ngare nyi Jisos ba no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:16; 14:5</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Owo abatꞌtoono Jisos bako kehm-e tongo re, “Wahr ebnyehn Ntul.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Á kehm faange bo re, “Tohko tiki jol re, n nyehne anv nya abang aba go ege abo, nya bo kum-e no, fere kooro ebnyohkobo go anv nyao, fere lak ebo ebame go ege a ngbaange, n nehm tiki taame.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Eji ma kang nfung enehkeni, abatꞌtoono Jisos kpe je edi jio. Tomos jolo a bo o fvfo. Bo ta abutahk kpee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:26">Jisos kehm kpe ba lohng go bo ellong, kpe kak bo nnyo re, “Belen elkoono!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Á kehm tongo Tomos re, “Koor-m ebnyohkobo a, wo fere nyehn abo enyame. Tanne ebo eba, wo lak-m go ngbaange. Ka kpe faabe, taame na taame!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomos kehm-e faange re, “Wo wo li Ntul ewame, a Esowo ebame!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Wobtaame tib eji a ma-m nyehna? Elfuulu li ka ane ba ki nyehn go amahr, bo taame na taame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:8; 2 Kor 4:18; 5:7</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejum ji wahnge bo nyono nwer nyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Jisos limi akpokosi gbalee go esamahr abatꞌtoono ebe, nya ki wob nwer nyia. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Nyaa bo nyono, goji ń lꞌtaame re, Jisos wo li Kraist ji Mmon no Esowo. Ń lꞌtaame, ḿ bahke bele elkpin go ege a mbing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:13</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpe song lohng go ellong abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Owo Jisos kehm kpe song tib elne go ellong abatꞌtoono ebe go eto ji Taibirias. Ana wo á tibi elne.<verse eid="JHN 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Saimon Pita, a Tomos ji bo jo lung-e re Ayafele, go Natanael ji lohng go Kena ji Galili, a abon ba Sibidi, go abatꞌtoono ebe bako na abal, bo ane kpee jolo o edi ajehng. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Saimon Pita kehm tongo bo re, “N kpꞌtahme nsahre.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bo kehm-e faange re, “E bahke tob tahm toon-a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bo kehm soro tahm, song yel go egbang. Jol ejumjum bo bobem atv mao ona.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Eji efungfu yahke se, Jisos kehm bake ba yiimi go nkpe eto. Abatꞌtoono ebe we liingem re, Jisos wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:14; Luk 24:16</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Abon ebame, ḿ bꞌbob nsahra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bo kehm-e faange re, “Eꞌee, ejumjum e bobem.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Yaken erim ebahne kak alahb go ejang eboblum bi egbang, ḿ bahke bobo nsahre.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:6">Owo bo kehm limi ano. Bo kpeem ma tohng erim bio, tibre nsahre ruru go erim sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 5:6</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ntꞌtoono no jo kor Jisos sꞌsehng, kehm tongo Pita re, “Ntul ewahre wo o!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:23</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:7">Saimon Pita wuku kan a re, Ntul wo, á kehm soro kak nsol enye go ege a ngubjing, nyi á yehke no lim eltum, kehm soro yehb yel go alahb.<verse eid="JHN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Abatꞌtoono Jisos bako fingi egbang, ba rehng go nkpe egbuk. Bo jo tohngo erim bi nsahre ma gbo gbalee, tibre nkpe egbuk gaam jol fee, jolo ejum eyake ego ewaya ajehng.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Eji bo rehnge go egbuk, bo kehm nyehne agun nya bo fohko go akal nsehng, fere nyehn nsahre kun go akal ngun, a ebred.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Koon nsahre nyindiki ba a nyi, nyi ń kpꞌna bobo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Owo Saimon Pita kehm tahme song tohng erim bio ona, lohng a bi go egbuk. Erim bio nsahre ruru sehng. Nfange enyamalahb bio jolo nnyamalahb atahl asehma kunu ewubu a nnyamalahb era. Jol eji nsahre ruru rur ano, erim yarem.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Baan, wahn ba bob ala go elehke ejum jia.” Jol ntꞌtoono ewe awohng awohng jolem, no sahbe no bahb-e re, “Wo nne awo?” Tibre bo jo kꞌkahn re, Ntul a Jisos wo. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jisos kehm bake ba rod ebred jio ka bo, tob rod nsahre nyio ka bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:20</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Nkpel nyia nyi biingi nkpel era nyi Jisos tibi abatꞌtoono ebe elne, bomo eji á nyahme go elkv.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos abola Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Eji bo ma li nsol alehke mal, Jisos kehm bungu tong Saimon Pita re, “Saimon ji mmon a Jon, anv, n kp-a koro sehnge ane bakoa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Pita kehm faange re, “Ee Ntul, a kpꞌkahne re, a kpo kor-m sehng.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Le abon ejoro ebame!” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Jisos kehm-e kpe bahb go nkpel ebal re, “Saimon ji mmon a Jon, anv, n kp-a kora?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Pita kehm-e faange re, “Ee Ntul, a kpꞌkahne re, a kp-m koro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jisos kehme tongo re, “Baabe ejoro ebame!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:2-4</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Jisos kehm-e kpe bahb go nkpel era re, “Saimon ji mmon a Jon, anv, n kp-a kora?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pita atahng kehm-e moongo, tib eji Jisos bahb-e nkpel era re, “N kp-a kora?” Á kehm faange re, “Ntul, a kpꞌkahne ejum ajehng ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:30</char></note> A kpꞌkahne re, a kp-m koro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Le ejoro ebame! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Etingitingi, n kpꞌbungu tong-a re, Ngare nyi a jolo njangkun, a jo gbaange egbaange eja go ebun, jo je edi ajehng ajehng ji kor-a no. Eji a ma kul, a bahke tanne abo enya. Nne nondiki bahk-a gbaange egbaange eja go ebun, ko-a tahm a na go edi ji ki-a kor re wo je.”<verse eid="JHN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Jisos bungu alum nyaa re, á tib Pita elkohn elkv ni á bahke kpoko, ka Esowo ellub. Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Tahm toon-m!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos, a ntꞌtoono ewe noko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pita kehm keebe, nyehn ntꞌtoona Jisos noko, kpi bo toono, no jo kor Jisos sꞌsehng, no ji kohlo Jisos, eji bo jo li nsol alehke elgung, fere bahb-e re, “Ntul, nne awo li nne no bahk-a gungu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Eji Pita nyehn-e no, á kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Ntul, nne noa mee?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jisos kehm faange Pita re, “Lꞌkor-m re á jol a, tete me n feere ba, elam eja sang, wo toon-m na toono!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Eka jia kehm yeere na yeere go ellong aneb Esowo re, ntꞌtoono a Jisos noo nehm kpo, jol eji Jisos ki-e tꞌtong ejumjum re, á nehm kpo. Alum nya Jisos bungu no li re, “Lꞌkor-m re á jol a, tete me n feere ba, elam eja sang.”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ntꞌtoona Jisos noo wo kpꞌyiimi ntianse go nsol nyia a. Ye wo fere nyon nwer nyia. E kpꞌkahne re, alum enye nya á yiimi ntianse lohko li go etingitingi.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Nsol nyehko nyia gbalee, nyi Jisos limi no. Li re bo nyono nsol kpee kak go awer, me m bum re, njini ebse sehng re awer nyaa kpee jol.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>